clinical,operational_support,procedure_equipment_usage,procedure_equipment_usage_id,procedure_equipment_usage_id,Procedure Equipment Usage ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,association_data,Unique surrogate identifier for each procedure-equipment usage record. Primary key.,
