clinical,patient_documentation,cdi_query,cdi_worksheet_id,cdi_worksheet_id,CDI Review Worksheet ID,BIGINT,,clinical.cdi_worksheet.cdi_worksheet_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the CDI encounter review worksheet from which this query was generated. Links individual queries to the broader encounter-level CDI review activity for holistic CDI program reporting.,
