clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,effective_until,effective_until,Effective Until Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date after which the template should no longer be used (null for indefinite).,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,hipaa_retention_annotation,hipaa_retention_annotation,HIPAA Retention Annotation,STRING,,,,,master_data,Free‑text annotation indicating HIPAA retention classification for the template.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,hipaa_retention_annotation_examples,hipaa_retention_annotation_examples,,STRING,,,,,master_data,description,
