clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,is_current_version,is_current_version,Current Version Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether this row represents the latest active version of the template.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,is_system_template,is_system_template,System Template Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,True if the template is a built‑in system template; false for user‑created templates.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,language,language,Template Language,STRING,,,,en|es|fr|de|zh,master_data,ISO language code of the template content.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,liquid_clustering_key,liquid_clustering_key,Liquid Clustering Key,STRING,,,,,master_data,Column(s) used for Databricks liquid clustering to improve query performance.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,note_template_name,note_template_name,Note Template Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,Human‑readable name of the clinical note template.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,note_template_status,note_template_status,Template Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive|deprecated|archived,master_data,Lifecycle status of the template.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,parent_note_template_id_fk,parent_note_template_id_fk,,BIGINT,,,,,master_data,FK to clinical.note_template.note_template_id,
