clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,retention_period_days,retention_period_days,Retention Period (Days),INT,,,,,master_data,Number of days the template record must be retained to satisfy HIPAA retention policies.,
clinical,patient_documentation,note_template,rls_predicate,rls_predicate,Row‑Level Security Predicate,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Row‑level security predicate for PHI (e.g., current_user() = provider_id).",
