clinical,patient_documentation,procedure_event,tertiary_procedure_anesthesia_provider_clinician_id,tertiary_procedure_anesthesia_provider_clinician_id,Anesthesia Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the anesthesiologist or CRNA responsible for anesthesia administration during the procedure. Required for anesthesia professional fee billing and credentialing compliance.,
