clinical,preventive_health,outbreak,case_fatality_rate,case_fatality_rate,Case Fatality Rate,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,"Percentage of cases that resulted in death, calculated as (death_count / total_case_count) * 100.",
