clinical,preventive_health,outbreak,public_health_alert_issued_flag,public_health_alert_issued_flag,Public Health Alert Issued Flag,BOOLEAN,,,"restricted,pii",,master_data,Indicates whether a public health alert or advisory was issued to the community or healthcare providers.,
clinical,preventive_health,outbreak,reporting_jurisdiction,reporting_jurisdiction,Reporting Jurisdiction,STRING,,,,,master_data,"State, territory, or country code of the jurisdiction responsible for outbreak reporting (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 or alpha-3).",
