consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,form_status,form_status,Form Status,STRING,,,,draft|pending_approval|active|superseded|retired|withdrawn,master_data,"Current lifecycle status of the consent form template: draft (under development), pending_approval (awaiting review), active (approved for use), superseded (replaced by newer version), retired (no longer in use), withdrawn (removed from circulation).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,interpreter_required_flag,interpreter_required_flag,Interpreter Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether an interpreter signature or attestation is required when the form is presented in a language different from the patients primary language. True if interpreter attestation is required, False otherwise.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,irb_approval_date,irb_approval_date,Institutional Review Board (IRB) Approval Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the IRB approved this research consent form template. Applicable only to research consent forms.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,irb_approval_number,irb_approval_number,Institutional Review Board (IRB) Approval Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,IRB protocol or approval reference number for research consent forms. Required for research studies involving human subjects under 45 CFR Part 46. Null for non-research consent forms.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,irb_expiration_date,irb_expiration_date,Institutional Review Board (IRB) Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the IRB approval for this research consent form expires and requires renewal. Applicable only to research consent forms.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,language_code,language_code,Language Code,STRING,,,,^[a-z]{2}(-[A-Z]{2})?$,master_data,"ISO 639-1 two-letter language code (with optional ISO 3166-1 country code) indicating the language of the consent form template (e.g., en, es, zh-CN, fr-CA).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,legal_representative_allowed_flag,legal_representative_allowed_flag,Legal Representative Allowed Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether a legal representative (guardian, power of attorney, parent) may sign this consent form on behalf of the patient. True if representative signature is permitted, False if patient signature is strictly required.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,minimum_age_requirement,minimum_age_requirement,Minimum Age Requirement,INT,,,,,master_data,Minimum age (in years) at which a patient may provide consent under this form template without parental or guardian involvement. Null if no age restriction applies or if form is not age-dependent.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,minor_assent_required_flag,minor_assent_required_flag,Minor Assent Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether assent from a minor patient (in addition to parental consent) is required for this consent form. Applicable primarily to research and certain treatment contexts. True if minor assent is required, False otherwise.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,modified_by_user,modified_by_user,Modified By User,STRING,,,,,master_data,Username or identifier of the system user who last modified this consent form template record.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when this consent form template record was last modified.,
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,reading_level,reading_level,Reading Level,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Assessed reading comprehension level required to understand the consent form content, typically expressed as grade level (e.g., 6th grade, 8th grade) or readability score (Flesch-Kincaid). Important for health literacy compliance.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,regulatory_basis,regulatory_basis,Regulatory Basis,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Primary legal or regulatory framework that mandates or governs this consent form (e.g., HIPAA Privacy Rule 45 CFR 164.508, 45 CFR Part 46 Common Rule, California CMIA, State-specific informed consent statute).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,retention_period_years,retention_period_years,Retention Period Years,INT,,,,,master_data,"Number of years that signed instances of this consent form must be retained per regulatory and legal requirements (e.g., 6 years per HIPAA, 7 years per state law, indefinitely for certain research consents).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,revocation_allowed_flag,revocation_allowed_flag,Revocation Allowed Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the patient has the right to revoke consent given under this form template. True if revocation is permitted, False if consent is irrevocable (rare, typically only in certain research contexts).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,revocation_instructions,revocation_instructions,Revocation Instructions,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Instructions provided to patients on how to revoke consent if revocation is allowed (e.g., written notice to Privacy Officer, submission of revocation form).",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,scope_of_consent,scope_of_consent,Scope of Consent,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Textual description of what the patient is consenting to, including specific procedures, data uses, disclosures, or participation activities covered by this form.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,version_number,version_number,Version Number,STRING,,,,^[0-9]+.[0-9]+(.[0-9]+)?$,master_data,"Version identifier for the consent form template following semantic versioning (e.g., 1.0, 2.1, 3.0.1). Incremented when form content or structure changes.",
consent,authorization_management,consent_form_template,witness_required_flag,witness_required_flag,Witness Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether a witness signature is required on this consent form in addition to the patient signature. True if witness is required, False otherwise.",
