encounter,patient_visit,visit,insurance_coverage_id,insurance_coverage_id,Primary Insurance Coverage ID,BIGINT,,patient.insurance_coverage.insurance_coverage_id,,,master_data,Reference to the primary insurance coverage record verified at the time of admission. Links to the patient insurance coverage domain for eligibility and authorization details.,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,patient_demographics_id,patient_demographics_id,,BIGINT,,patient.demographics.demographics_id,,,master_data,FK to patient.demographics.demographics_id,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,primary_mpi_record_id,primary_mpi_record_id,Patient ID,BIGINT,,patient.mpi_record.mpi_record_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,master_data,Reference to the patient who is the subject of this visit. Links the encounter domain to the patient domain master record.,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,primary_visit_admitting_provider_clinician_id,primary_visit_admitting_provider_clinician_id,Admitting Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,master_data,Reference to the clinician who formally admitted the patient to the facility. May differ from the attending provider. Required for inpatient UB-04 billing and DRG assignment.,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,tertiary_visit_discharging_provider_clinician_id,tertiary_visit_discharging_provider_clinician_id,Discharging Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,master_data,"Reference to the clinician who authorized and completed the patient discharge. Used for care transition accountability, discharge instruction tracking, and quality audits.",
encounter,patient_visit,visit,training_completion_id,training_completion_id,Training Completion Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,compliance.training_completion.training_completion_id,,,master_data,"Foreign key linking to compliance.training_completion. Business justification: Training effectiveness validation requires auditing staff performance on actual encounters (e.g., did staff who completed sepsis training properly document sepsis cases? Did EMTALA-trained staff compl",
encounter,patient_visit,visit,visit_admission_source_care_site_id,visit_admission_source_care_site_id,,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,master_data,FK to facility.care_site.care_site_id,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,visit_admitting_clinician_id,visit_admitting_clinician_id,,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,master_data,FK to provider.clinician.clinician_id,
encounter,patient_visit,visit,visit_care_site_id,visit_care_site_id,Facility ID,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,master_data,"Reference to the facility or care setting where the visit occurred (hospital, clinic, outpatient center, telehealth hub). Links to the facility domain.",
