facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,accreditation_decision,accreditation_decision,Accreditation Decision,STRING,,,,accredited|accredited_with_follow_up|preliminary_denial|denied|not_applicable,transactional_data,Specific accreditation decision issued by TJC or other accrediting body following the inspection.,
facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,certification_decision,certification_decision,Certification Decision,STRING,,,,certified|conditional_certification|certification_denied|not_applicable,transactional_data,Specific certification decision issued by CMS or state authority following the inspection.,
facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,cms_certification_number,cms_certification_number,CMS (Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services) Certification Number,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"CMS-assigned certification number associated with this inspection, if applicable.",
facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,complaint_based_flag,complaint_based_flag,Complaint-Based Inspection Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether the inspection was triggered by a complaint or allegation rather than a routine scheduled survey.,
