facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,immediate_jeopardy_count,immediate_jeopardy_count,Immediate Jeopardy (IJ) Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Number of findings classified as immediate jeopardy, indicating situations where serious injury, harm, impairment, or death has occurred or is likely to occur.",
facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,inspector_credentials,inspector_credentials,Inspector Credentials,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Professional credentials or certifications held by the inspector (e.g., RN, MD, CIH, PE).",
