facility,compliance_safety,facility_inspection,life_safety_code_edition,life_safety_code_edition,Life Safety Code Edition,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Edition of the NFPA (National Fire Protection Association) 101 Life Safety Code used as the standard for this inspection.,
