facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,equipment_name,equipment_name,Equipment Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Common business name or description of the equipment asset (e.g., Ventilator, MRI Scanner, Infusion Pump).",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,equipment_type,equipment_type,Equipment Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Detailed equipment type or subclass within the category (e.g., CT Scanner, Infusion Pump, Defibrillator).",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,facility_service_contract_expiration_date,facility_service_contract_expiration_date,Service Contract Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the current service contract expires. Used for contract renewal planning.,
