facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,infection_control_category,infection_control_category,Infection Control Category,STRING,,,,critical|semi_critical|non_critical|not_applicable,master_data,"Spaulding classification for infection control and sterilization requirements. Critical items enter sterile tissue, semi-critical contact mucous membranes, non-critical contact intact skin.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,installation_date,installation_date,Installation Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the equipment was physically installed and commissioned at the current or original location.,
