facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,manufacturer,manufacturer,Manufacturer Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,Name of the equipment manufacturer or original equipment manufacturer (OEM).,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,mobility_indicator,mobility_indicator,Mobility Indicator,STRING,,,,fixed|portable|mobile,master_data,"Indicates whether the equipment is permanently installed (fixed), can be moved by staff (portable), or is mounted on wheels/cart (mobile). Impacts tracking and location management requirements.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,model_number,model_number,Model Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,Manufacturer model number or designation for this equipment type.,
