facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,pm_compliance_status,pm_compliance_status,Preventive Maintenance (PM) Compliance Status,STRING,,,,compliant|overdue|upcoming|not_applicable,master_data,Current compliance status of preventive maintenance schedule. Overdue status triggers escalation and may impact accreditation.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,pm_frequency_days,pm_frequency_days,Preventive Maintenance (PM) Frequency in Days,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of days between scheduled preventive maintenance activities. Determined by manufacturer recommendations and risk category.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,power_requirements,power_requirements,Power Requirements,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Electrical power specifications for the equipment (voltage, amperage, phase). Critical for facility planning and electrical safety.",
