facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,sap_equipment_number,sap_equipment_number,SAP Equipment Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Equipment master record number in SAP PM (Plant Maintenance) module. Primary integration key for work orders, maintenance plans, and cost tracking.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,serial_number,serial_number,Manufacturer Serial Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Manufacturer-assigned serial number for the equipment unit. Critical for warranty claims, recalls, and service history tracking.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_asset,udi,udi,Unique Device Identifier (UDI),STRING,,,,,master_data,FDA-mandated Unique Device Identifier for medical devices. Enables traceability throughout the device lifecycle and supports recall management.,
