facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,equipment_employee_id,equipment_employee_id,Competency Verifier Employee ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,association_data,"Employee ID of the clinical educator, biomedical engineer, or supervisor who verified the employees competency to operate this equipment. Supports audit trail and accountability.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,primary_employee_id,primary_employee_id,Equipment Authorization - Employee Id,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,association_data,Foreign key linking to the employee who is authorized to operate the equipment,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,authorization_status,authorization_status,Authorization Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current status of the equipment authorization. ACTIVE indicates valid authorization; EXPIRED indicates recertification needed; SUSPENDED indicates temporary hold; REVOKED indicates authorization withdrawn; PENDING indicates awaiting competency verification.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,competency_verified_date,competency_verified_date,Competency Verified Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,"Date when the employees competency to operate this specific equipment was verified through testing, observation, or certification. Required for TJC HR.01.06.01 compliance and clinical engineering safety protocols.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,notes,notes,Authorization Notes,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Free-text notes regarding special conditions, restrictions, or context for this equipment authorization (e.g., Authorized for day shift only, Requires supervision for first 30 days).",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,primary_user_flag,primary_user_flag,Primary User Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,"Indicates whether this employee is designated as the primary user responsible for this equipment asset. Used for maintenance coordination, recall notifications, and equipment assignment tracking.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,provider_assignment_end_date,provider_assignment_end_date,Assignment End Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when the equipment authorization expires or was terminated. Null indicates active authorization. Used for recertification scheduling and access control.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,provider_assignment_start_date,provider_assignment_start_date,Assignment Start Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when the equipment authorization became effective. Used for compliance tracking and audit trails.,
