facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,recertification_due_date,recertification_due_date,Recertification Due Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,"Date when the employee must complete recertification or competency reassessment for this equipment. Frequency determined by equipment risk category, manufacturer requirements, and organizational policy.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,equipment_authorization,training_completion_date,training_completion_date,Training Completion Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when the employee completed formal training on this equipment type. May precede competency verification date. Used for training program tracking and compliance reporting.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,maintenance_order,maintenance_order_id,maintenance_order_id,Maintenance Order Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for the maintenance work order. Primary key for the maintenance order entity.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,maintenance_order,care_site_id,care_site_id,Location Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,transactional_data,"Reference to the facility location (room, unit, building) where the maintenance work is to be performed. Used when work order applies to infrastructure rather than a specific asset.",
facility,equipment_maintenance,maintenance_order,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to finance.cost_center. Business justification: Maintenance work orders incur labor and parts costs (labor_cost, parts_cost, total_cost fields present) that must be charged to a specific cost center for financial reporting, budget tracking, and var",
