facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,auto_generate_work_order,auto_generate_work_order,Auto Generate Work Order Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Boolean flag indicating whether work orders should be automatically generated in SAP PM when the next due date is reached.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,cost_center,cost_center,Cost Center,STRING,,,,,master_data,Financial cost center to which preventive maintenance labor and materials costs should be charged.,
facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when this preventive maintenance schedule record was first created in the system.,
