facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,maintenance_type,maintenance_type,Maintenance Type,STRING,,,,inspection|calibration|cleaning|lubrication|testing|replacement,master_data,Category of preventive maintenance activity to be performed on the equipment or facility system.,
