facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,schedule_status,schedule_status,Schedule Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive|suspended|completed,master_data,"Current lifecycle status of the preventive maintenance schedule, indicating whether it is actively generating work orders.",
