facility,equipment_maintenance,pm_schedule,created_by,created_by,Created By User,STRING,,,,,master_data,User ID or name of the person who created this preventive maintenance schedule record.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,bed_status_event_id,bed_status_event_id,Bed Status Event ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for each bed status change event. Primary key for the bed status event transactional record.,
