facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,environmental_service_request_id,environmental_service_request_id,Housekeeping Work Order ID,BIGINT,,facility.environmental_service_request.environmental_service_request_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the environmental services work order created for bed cleaning. Enables discharge-to-clean cycle time tracking.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,maintenance_order_id,maintenance_order_id,Maintenance Work Order ID,BIGINT,,facility.maintenance_order.maintenance_order_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the biomedical engineering or facilities maintenance work order if the bed requires repair or preventive maintenance.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,mpi_record_id,mpi_record_id,Patient ID,BIGINT,,patient.mpi_record.mpi_record_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,transactional_data,"Reference to the patient associated with this bed status event (e.g., patient being admitted or discharged). Null for non-patient-related events like maintenance.",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,primary_bed_unit_id,primary_bed_unit_id,Unit ID,BIGINT,,facility.unit.unit_id,,,transactional_data,"Reference to the nursing unit or department where the bed resides (e.g., ICU, ED, Medical-Surgical).",
