facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,actual_availability_timestamp,actual_availability_timestamp,Actual Availability Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Actual date and time when the bed became available after cleaning or maintenance. Enables cycle time variance analysis.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,acuity_level,acuity_level,Acuity Level,STRING,,,,critical|acute|intermediate|observation|general,transactional_data,Clinical acuity level associated with the bed at the time of the event. Aligns bed capacity with patient care intensity requirements.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,adt_event_type,adt_event_type,ADT (Admit-Discharge-Transfer) Event Type,STRING,,,,admit|discharge|transfer|cancel|update,transactional_data,Type of ADT event that triggered this bed status change. Aligns with HL7 ADT message types for interoperability.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,bed_assignment_method,bed_assignment_method,Bed Assignment Method,STRING,,,,manual|automated|hybrid,transactional_data,"Method used to assign or change the bed status (manual by staff, automated by system algorithm, or hybrid). Supports workflow optimization analysis.",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,blocked_reason_category,blocked_reason_category,Blocked Reason Category,STRING,,,,construction|equipment_failure|staffing_shortage|infection_control|administrative|other,transactional_data,High-level category for why a bed is blocked or unavailable. Supports root cause analysis of capacity constraints.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,consent_event_sequence_number,consent_event_sequence_number,Event Sequence Number,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Sequential number indicating the order of status changes for this bed. Supports chronological event reconstruction and audit trails.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,consent_event_timestamp,consent_event_timestamp,Event Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Precise date and time when the bed status change occurred. Critical for discharge-to-clean cycle time analysis and real-time bed board operations.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Timestamp when this bed status event record was first created in the system. Supports audit trail and data lineage tracking.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,duration_minutes,duration_minutes,Duration Minutes,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Duration in minutes that the bed remained in the prior status before this event. Calculated field for cycle time analysis.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,expected_availability_timestamp,expected_availability_timestamp,Expected Availability Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Projected date and time when the bed will become available for the next patient. Used for bed turnover forecasting and transfer planning.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,initiating_user_role,initiating_user_role,Initiating User Role,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Role or job function of the user who initiated the status change (e.g., Registered Nurse, Environmental Services Technician, Bed Coordinator).",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,is_elective_flag,is_elective_flag,Is Elective Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether this bed status change is related to a scheduled or elective admission (e.g., planned surgery).",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,is_emergency_flag,is_emergency_flag,Is Emergency Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether this bed status change is related to an emergency department admission or urgent care scenario.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,isolation_type,isolation_type,Isolation Type,STRING,,,,contact|droplet|airborne|protective|none,transactional_data,"Type of infection control isolation precaution applied to the bed (e.g., contact, droplet, airborne, protective). Critical for infection prevention and bed assignment logic.",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,last_modified_timestamp,last_modified_timestamp,Last Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Timestamp when this bed status event record was last updated. Enables change tracking and data quality monitoring.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,new_status_code,new_status_code,New Status Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,The bed status after this event. Core field for real-time bed availability tracking and capacity management. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: occupied|available|cleaning|maintenance|blocked|reserved|isolation — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,notes,notes,Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Free-text notes or comments entered by staff regarding this bed status change. Provides qualitative context for operational review.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,prior_status_code,prior_status_code,Prior Status Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,The bed status immediately before this event. Enables state transition analysis and workflow tracking. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: occupied|available|cleaning|maintenance|blocked|reserved|isolation — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,priority_flag,priority_flag,Priority Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether this bed status change is high-priority (e.g., emergency department hold, urgent transfer). Supports command center escalation workflows.",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,reason_code,reason_code,Reason Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Standardized code indicating why the bed status changed (e.g., patient discharge, cleaning request, maintenance hold, isolation precaution, blocked for construction, reserved for transfer). [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: patient_discharge|patient_admission|cleaning_request|maintenance_hold|isolation_precaution|construction_block|transfer_reserved|emergency_hold — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,reason_description,reason_description,Reason Description,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Free-text explanation providing additional context for the status change. Supplements the standardized reason code.,
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,source_system_code,source_system_code,Source System Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Code identifying the originating system that generated this bed status event (e.g., Epic ADT, Cerner Millennium, bed management system).",
facility,operations_capacity,bed_status_event,source_system_event_code,source_system_event_code,Source System Event ID,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier from the source system for this event. Enables traceability and reconciliation with operational systems.,
