facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,or_suite_id,or_suite_id,Block Assignment - Or Suite Id,BIGINT,,facility.or_suite.or_suite_id,,,association_data,Foreign key linking to the operating room suite where the block time is allocated,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,block_start_time,block_start_time,,TIMESTAMP,,,entity_type=TIME,,association_data,"Start time of the OR block assignment, stored as TIMESTAMP for Databricks/Spark SQL compatibility",
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,block_time_end,block_time_end,Block End Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"End time of the recurring OR block window (e.g., 15:00:00 for afternoon end). Defines when the surgeons allocated OR time ends.",
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,block_time_start,block_time_start,Block Start Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"Start time of the recurring OR block window (e.g., 07:00:00 for a morning block). Defines when the surgeons allocated OR time begins.",
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,block_type,block_type,Block Type,STRING,,,,,association_data,Classification of the OR block assignment. Dedicated = surgeon has exclusive use; Shared = multiple surgeons share the block; Flex = can be released if unused; Release = must be released if not booked by deadline; On-Call = reserved for emergency cases.,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Assignment Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Date and time when this block assignment record was created in the system. Audit trail for block allocation decisions.,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,day_of_week,day_of_week,Day of Week,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Day of the week on which this recurring block assignment is scheduled (e.g., Monday, Wednesday). Supports weekly recurring block schedules.",
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,effective_date,effective_date,Block Effective Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this block assignment becomes active. Supports future-dated block schedule changes and contract renewals.,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,expiration_date,expiration_date,Block Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this block assignment expires or is scheduled for review. Null indicates an ongoing block assignment. Used for contract-based block allocations and periodic utilization reviews.,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Assignment Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"Date and time when this block assignment record was last modified. Tracks changes to block schedules, priorities, or terms.",
