facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,provider_assignment_status,provider_assignment_status,Assignment Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current lifecycle status of the block assignment. Active = currently in effect; Suspended = temporarily paused; Expired = past expiration date; Pending = future-dated; Cancelled = terminated before expiration.,
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,release_deadline_hours,release_deadline_hours,Block Release Deadline,INT,,,,,association_data,"Number of hours before the block start time by which the surgeon must release unused block time (e.g., 72 hours). Allows facility to reallocate unused OR capacity.",
facility,operations_capacity,block_assignment,utilization_threshold_pct,utilization_threshold_pct,Block Utilization Threshold,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,association_data,"Minimum utilization percentage required for the surgeon to retain this block assignment (e.g., 80.00 means surgeon must use at least 80% of allocated block time). Used for block release policies and utilization management.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,capacity_snapshot_id,capacity_snapshot_id,Capacity Snapshot Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for the capacity snapshot record. Primary key.,
