facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,unit_id,unit_id,Unit Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.unit.unit_id,,,transactional_data,"Reference to the specific unit or department within the care site (e.g., ICU, ED, NICU, medical-surgical unit). Nullable if snapshot is at care site level.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,alternate_care_site_activation_status,alternate_care_site_activation_status,Alternate Care Site Activation Status,STRING,,,,activated|standby|inactive,transactional_data,"Indicates whether alternate care sites (field hospitals, temporary facilities) have been activated to handle overflow capacity during emergencies.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,ambulance_diversion_status,ambulance_diversion_status,Ambulance Diversion Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive,transactional_data,"Indicates whether the facility is currently on ambulance diversion, meaning incoming ambulances are being redirected to other facilities due to capacity constraints.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,available_beds,available_beds,Available Beds,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Number of staffed beds that are immediately available for patient assignment (not occupied, not in cleaning, not out of service).",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,bariatric_beds_available,bariatric_beds_available,Bariatric Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of bariatric-capable beds (designed for patients with high body mass index) currently available.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,beds_in_cleaning,beds_in_cleaning,Beds in Cleaning,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of beds currently undergoing environmental services cleaning or terminal cleaning after patient discharge. These beds are temporarily unavailable.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,beds_out_of_service,beds_out_of_service,Beds Out of Service,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Number of beds that are out of service due to maintenance, equipment failure, isolation requirements, or other operational reasons.",
