facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,ed_bypass_status,ed_bypass_status,Emergency Department (ED) Bypass Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive,transactional_data,"Indicates whether the Emergency Department is on bypass status, temporarily not accepting new patients due to capacity or operational constraints.",
