facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,eoc_activation_status,eoc_activation_status,Emergency Operations Center (EOC) Activation Status,STRING,,,,activated|standby|inactive,transactional_data,Indicates whether the hospital Emergency Operations Center has been activated to coordinate emergency response and capacity management.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,icu_bypass_status,icu_bypass_status,Intensive Care Unit (ICU) Bypass Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive,transactional_data,"Indicates whether the ICU is on bypass status, temporarily not accepting new admissions due to capacity constraints.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,icu_census,icu_census,Intensive Care Unit (ICU) Census,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Total number of patients currently in the Intensive Care Unit at the time of the snapshot.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,isolation_beds_available,isolation_beds_available,Isolation Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of isolation-capable beds (negative pressure or airborne infection isolation rooms) currently available for patients requiring isolation precautions.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,nicu_census,nicu_census,Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU) Census,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Total number of neonatal patients currently in the Neonatal Intensive Care Unit at the time of the snapshot.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,observation_beds_available,observation_beds_available,Observation Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of observation beds currently available for patients under observation status (not formally admitted).,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,occupancy_percentage,occupancy_percentage,Occupancy Percentage,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,transactional_data,Percentage of staffed beds that are currently occupied. Calculated as (occupied_beds / total_staffed_beds) * 100. Key performance indicator for capacity management.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,occupied_beds,occupied_beds,Occupied Beds,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of beds currently occupied by patients at the time of the snapshot.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,or_utilization_percentage,or_utilization_percentage,Operating Room (OR) Utilization Percentage,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,transactional_data,Percentage of Operating Room capacity currently in use at the time of the snapshot. Calculated as (active OR cases / total OR capacity) * 100.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,pediatric_beds_available,pediatric_beds_available,Pediatric Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of pediatric beds currently available for patients under 18 years of age.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,snapshot_source_system,snapshot_source_system,Snapshot Source System,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"The system or application that generated this capacity snapshot (e.g., Epic ADT, Hospital Command Center Dashboard, Bed Management System).",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,snapshot_timestamp,snapshot_timestamp,Snapshot Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,The exact date and time when this capacity snapshot was captured. This is the principal business event timestamp for real-time capacity tracking.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,snapshot_type,snapshot_type,Snapshot Type,STRING,,,,scheduled|on_demand|emergency|automated,transactional_data,"Indicates whether this snapshot was captured as part of a scheduled interval, on-demand request, emergency response, or automated system trigger.",
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,surge_beds_available,surge_beds_available,Surge Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of surge beds that can be activated in an emergency or disaster scenario. Surge beds are additional capacity beyond normal staffed beds.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,telemetry_beds_available,telemetry_beds_available,Telemetry Beds Available,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of telemetry-capable beds currently available for patients requiring continuous cardiac monitoring.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,total_licensed_beds,total_licensed_beds,Total Licensed Beds,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Total number of beds the facility is licensed to operate by state health department. This is the regulatory maximum capacity.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,total_staffed_beds,total_staffed_beds,Total Staffed Beds,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Total number of beds that are currently staffed and available for patient assignment. Staffed beds are a subset of licensed beds and reflect operational capacity.,
facility,operations_capacity,capacity_snapshot,ventilator_availability_count,ventilator_availability_count,Ventilator Availability Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of mechanical ventilators currently available and ready for patient use. Critical for respiratory emergency preparedness and pandemic response.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,environmental_service_request_id,environmental_service_request_id,Environmental Service Request ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for the environmental services work request. Primary key.,
