facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,cleaning_protocol_used,cleaning_protocol_used,Cleaning Protocol Used,STRING,,,,contact precaution|c diff protocol|covid protocol|standard|enhanced|mrsa protocol,transactional_data,Specific cleaning and disinfection protocol applied based on infection control requirements. Contact precaution for resistant organisms; C. diff protocol uses sporicidal agents; COVID protocol follows CDC guidance; MRSA protocol for methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus; standard for routine cleaning; enhanced for high-touch surfaces.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,completion_timestamp,completion_timestamp,Completion Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the environmental services work was completed and the space was ready for occupancy.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this record was first created in the data platform.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,discharge_to_clean_cycle_time_minutes,discharge_to_clean_cycle_time_minutes,Discharge to Clean Cycle Time Minutes,"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,transactional_data,Total elapsed time in minutes from patient discharge to room ready for next admission. Critical metric for bed throughput optimization and Emergency Department (ED) boarding reduction.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,disinfectant_product_used,disinfectant_product_used,Disinfectant Product Used,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Name or identifier of the EPA-registered disinfectant product used for cleaning and disinfection.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,facility_inspection_timestamp,facility_inspection_timestamp,Inspection Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the quality inspection was performed.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,infection_prevention_alert_flag,infection_prevention_alert_flag,Infection Prevention Alert Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether this request was flagged for infection prevention review due to Healthcare-Associated Infection (HAI) risk or outbreak investigation.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,isolation_precaution_type,isolation_precaution_type,Isolation Precaution Type,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Type of isolation precaution in effect for the location, such as contact, droplet, airborne, or protective environment. Determines cleaning protocol requirements. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: contact|droplet|airborne|protective environment|standard|contact plus|neutropenic|reverse isolation — promote to reference product]",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,last_updated_timestamp,last_updated_timestamp,Last Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this record was last modified in the data platform.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,notes,notes,Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text notes or comments about the environmental service request, including special instructions, observations, or issues encountered.",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,patient_discharge_timestamp,patient_discharge_timestamp,Patient Discharge Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,"Date and time when the patient was discharged from the bed or room, triggering the need for terminal or discharge cleaning. Used to calculate discharge-to-clean cycle time.",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,priority_level,priority_level,Priority Level,STRING,,,,stat|urgent|routine|scheduled,transactional_data,Urgency classification of the environmental service request. STAT requires immediate response; urgent within 30 minutes; routine within 2 hours; scheduled at predetermined time.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,quality_inspection_performed_flag,quality_inspection_performed_flag,Quality Inspection Performed Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether a quality inspection was conducted after cleaning completion.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,quality_inspection_result,quality_inspection_result,Quality Inspection Result,STRING,,,,passed|failed|not inspected,transactional_data,Outcome of the quality inspection. Passed indicates the space meets cleanliness standards; failed requires rework; not inspected when inspection was not performed.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,request_number,request_number,Environmental Services (EVS) Request Number,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Business identifier for the environmental service request, used for tracking and communication.",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,request_status,request_status,Request Status,STRING,,,,pending|assigned|in progress|completed|cancelled|on hold,transactional_data,Current lifecycle status of the environmental service request.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,request_timestamp,request_timestamp,Request Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the environmental service request was created. Critical for measuring response time and bed throughput metrics.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,request_to_start_time_minutes,request_to_start_time_minutes,Request to Start Time Minutes,"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,transactional_data,Elapsed time in minutes from request creation to work start. Measures environmental services responsiveness.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,request_type,request_type,Environmental Services (EVS) Request Type,STRING,,,,terminal clean|discharge clean|isolation clean|routine clean|spill response|biohazard cleanup,transactional_data,Type of environmental service requested. Terminal clean is comprehensive end-of-stay cleaning; discharge clean is post-patient departure; isolation clean follows contact precaution protocols; routine clean is scheduled maintenance; spill response addresses immediate contamination; biohazard cleanup handles infectious or hazardous materials.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,source_system,source_system,Source System,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name of the operational system that originated the environmental service request, such as Epic EHR (Electronic Health Record), bed management system, or nurse call system.",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,special_equipment_required,special_equipment_required,Special Equipment Required,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Description of any special equipment needed for the cleaning task, such as ultraviolet (UV) disinfection devices, electrostatic sprayers, or HEPA vacuums.",
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,start_timestamp,start_timestamp,Start Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the environmental services staff began the cleaning or disinfection work.,
facility,operations_capacity,environmental_service_request,work_duration_minutes,work_duration_minutes,Work Duration Minutes,"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"Actual time in minutes spent performing the cleaning or disinfection work, from start to completion.",
