facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,unit_id,unit_id,Unit Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,facility.unit.unit_id,,,master_data,"Foreign key linking to facility.unit. Business justification: Clinical services are often unit-specific (Cardiac Surgery in OR Unit 3, Interventional Cardiology in Cath Lab Unit). Adding unit_id enables unit-level service delivery tracking, supports unit-specifi",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,workforce_org_unit_id,workforce_org_unit_id,Administrative Owner Department Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.org_unit.org_unit_id,,,master_data,Reference to the department or organizational unit that has administrative ownership and operational responsibility for the service.,
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,accreditation_body,accreditation_body,Accreditation Body,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Name of the external accrediting or certifying organization that has granted accreditation or certification for this service, such as The Joint Commission, American College of Surgeons, Commission on Cancer, or specialty-specific bodies.",
