facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,facility_service_name,facility_service_name,Service Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Full descriptive name of the clinical service or program offered at the care site, such as Cardiac Surgery, Level I Trauma Center, Comprehensive Stroke Center, NICU Level III, Radiation Oncology, Behavioral Health, or Telehealth.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,facility_service_status,facility_service_status,Service Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive|suspended|planned|discontinued,master_data,"Current operational status of the service indicating whether it is actively offered, temporarily suspended, planned for future launch, or discontinued.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,license_expiration_date,license_expiration_date,License Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the service license expires and must be renewed to continue legal operation of the service.,
