facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,line,line,Service Line,STRING,,,,,master_data,"High-level service line grouping such as Cardiovascular, Neurosciences, Oncology, Womens Health, Pediatrics, Behavioral Health, Emergency Services, or Surgical Services.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,nicu_level,nicu_level,Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU) Level,STRING,,,,level_i|level_ii|level_iii|level_iv|not_applicable,master_data,American Academy of Pediatrics NICU level designation (Level I through Level IV) indicating the complexity of neonatal care capabilities. Not applicable for non-neonatal services.,
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,patient_access_phone,patient_access_phone,Patient Access Phone Number,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_phone",,master_data,"Primary phone number for patients or referring providers to contact for scheduling, inquiries, or referrals to this service.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,payer_contracted_flag,payer_contracted_flag,Payer Contracted Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Boolean indicator of whether the service is included in payer contracts and eligible for reimbursement under managed care agreements.,
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,referral_required_flag,referral_required_flag,Referral Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean indicator of whether patients require a physician referral or prior authorization to access this service, commonly used for specialty services and payer contracting.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,start_date,start_date,Service Start Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,"Date on which the service was first made available to patients at the care site, marking the operational launch of the service or program.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,stroke_center_designation,stroke_center_designation,Stroke Center Designation,STRING,,,,comprehensive|primary|acute_ready|thrombectomy_capable|not_applicable,master_data,"The Joint Commission stroke center certification level indicating the facilitys capability to provide stroke care, such as Comprehensive Stroke Center, Primary Stroke Center, Acute Stroke Ready, or Thrombectomy-Capable. Not applicable for non-stroke services.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,telehealth_enabled_flag,telehealth_enabled_flag,Telehealth Enabled Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean indicator of whether the service can be delivered via telehealth or virtual care modalities, supporting remote patient access.",
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,trauma_level,trauma_level,Trauma Level,STRING,,,,level_i|level_ii|level_iii|level_iv|level_v|not_applicable,master_data,American College of Surgeons trauma center designation level (Level I through Level V) indicating the capability and resources available for trauma care. Not applicable for non-trauma services.,
facility,operations_capacity,facility_service,updated_timestamp,updated_timestamp,Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp indicating when this facility service record was last modified or updated in the system.,
