facility,site_management,facility_organization,facility_service_area_description,facility_service_area_description,Service Area Description,STRING,,,,,master_data,Geographic description of the primary service area or catchment area served by the organization.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,facility_type,facility_type,Facility Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,Specific facility classification based on care delivery focus and patient population served.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,fax_number,fax_number,Fax Number,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_phone",,master_data,Fax number for document transmission to the organization.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,health_system_name,health_system_name,Health System Name,STRING,,,"restricted,pii",,master_data,Name of the integrated delivery network or health system to which this organization belongs.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,last_modified_timestamp,last_modified_timestamp,Last Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when this organization record was last updated.,
