facility,site_management,facility_organization,license_expiration_date,license_expiration_date,License Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the current facility license expires.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,license_number,license_number,License Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,State-issued license number authorizing the organization to operate as a healthcare facility.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,license_status,license_status,License Status,STRING,,,,,master_data,Current status of the facility operating license.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,medicaid_provider_number,medicaid_provider_number,Medicaid Provider Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,State-issued Medicaid provider identification number for billing and reimbursement.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,medicare_provider_number,medicare_provider_number,Medicare Provider Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,Six-digit CMS Certification Number (CCN) identifying the organization for Medicare billing.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,national_provider_identifier,national_provider_identifier,National Provider Identifier,STRING,,,,,master_data,Unique 10-digit identification number issued by CMS for healthcare providers and organizations.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,operational_start_date,operational_start_date,Operational Start Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the facility began active operations and patient care delivery.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,operational_status,operational_status,Operational Status,STRING,,,,,master_data,Current operational state of the organization in its lifecycle.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,organization_name,organization_name,Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Official legal name of the healthcare organization, facility, or entity.",
facility,site_management,facility_organization,ownership_type,ownership_type,Ownership Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,Legal ownership structure and governance model of the organization.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,phone_number,phone_number,Phone Number,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_phone",,master_data,Primary contact phone number for the organization.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,postal_code,postal_code,Postal Code,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",,master_data,ZIP code or postal code for the facility address.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,staffed_bed_count,staffed_bed_count,Staffed Bed Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of beds that are currently staffed and available for patient use.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,state_province,state_province,State Province,STRING,,,,,master_data,Two-letter state or province code where the facility is located.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,tax_identification_number,tax_identification_number,Tax Identification Number,STRING,,,dbx_confidential,,master_data,Federal Employer Identification Number (EIN) or Tax ID assigned by the IRS.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,teaching_hospital_indicator,teaching_hospital_indicator,Teaching Hospital Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the facility is affiliated with a medical school and provides graduate medical education.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,total_bed_count,total_bed_count,Total Bed Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Total number of licensed beds available across all units in the facility.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,trauma_level,trauma_level,Trauma Level,STRING,,,,,master_data,Trauma center designation level indicating capability to treat severe injuries.,
facility,site_management,facility_organization,website_url,website_url,Website Url,STRING,,,,,master_data,Official website URL for the organization.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,or_suite_id,or_suite_id,Operating Room (OR) Suite Identifier,BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the operating room suite. Primary key for the OR suite master data.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,building_id,building_id,Building Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,facility.building.building_id,,,master_data,"Foreign key linking to facility.building. Business justification: OR suites are physical spaces within buildings. Adding building_id enables facility management operations (building maintenance schedules, HVAC systems, emergency power), space planning, and building-",
facility,site_management,or_suite,care_site_id,care_site_id,Facility Identifier,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,master_data,Reference to the parent healthcare facility or hospital campus where this OR suite is located. Links to the facility master for multi-site integrated delivery networks.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,unit_id,unit_id,Unit Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,facility.unit.unit_id,,,master_data,Foreign key linking to facility.unit. Business justification: OR suites are clinical units within the facility hierarchy. Adding unit_id enables proper organizational hierarchy (care_site → building → unit → OR suite) and supports unit-level operational reportin,
facility,site_management,or_suite,accreditation_status,accreditation_status,Accreditation Status,STRING,,,,accredited|provisional|not_accredited|pending_survey,master_data,"Current accreditation status of the OR suite or parent surgical services program by The Joint Commission (TJC), AAAHC, or other accrediting body. Accreditation is required for many payer contracts and demonstrates compliance with quality and safety standards.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,anesthesia_machine_model,anesthesia_machine_model,Anesthesia Machine Model,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Manufacturer and model of the anesthesia delivery system installed in the OR. Critical for anesthesia provider training, maintenance scheduling, and gas scavenging system compatibility.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,boom_configuration,boom_configuration,Surgical Boom Configuration,STRING,,,,none|single_ceiling_boom|dual_ceiling_boom|articulating_arm|wall_mounted,master_data,"Type and configuration of ceiling-mounted or wall-mounted booms for surgical lights, anesthesia equipment, monitors, and power/data connections. Dual booms provide greater flexibility for complex procedures. Configuration impacts room layout and equipment access.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Record Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Date and time when this OR suite record was first created in the system. Used for audit trail and data lineage tracking.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,emergency_power_backup_flag,emergency_power_backup_flag,Emergency Power Backup Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the OR is connected to the emergency power system (generator or UPS) to maintain critical functions during power outages. Required for life safety and continuation of surgical procedures.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,emergency_use_flag,emergency_use_flag,Emergency Use Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether this OR is designated for emergency and trauma cases. Emergency ORs are held open or have priority access rules in surgical scheduling systems to ensure rapid availability for urgent cases.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,equipment_inventory_list,equipment_inventory_list,Equipment Inventory List,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Comma-separated or structured list of major fixed and mobile equipment assigned to this OR suite (e.g., surgical table model, anesthesia machine, electrosurgical unit, video tower, microscope). Used for preventive maintenance scheduling and equipment tracking.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,fire_suppression_system_type,fire_suppression_system_type,Fire Suppression System Type,STRING,,,,sprinkler|clean_agent|water_mist|none,master_data,"Type of fire suppression system installed in the OR suite. Clean agent systems (e.g., FM-200, Novec 1230) are preferred for ORs to avoid water damage to sensitive equipment. Sprinkler systems are common but may require equipment protection. Critical for life safety and regulatory compliance.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,hvac_air_exchange_rate_per_hour,hvac_air_exchange_rate_per_hour,Heating Ventilation and Air Conditioning (HVAC) Air Exchange Rate Per Hour,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of complete air changes per hour in the operating room. Minimum 15 air changes per hour is required for ORs per FGI guidelines; higher rates (20-25) are used in ultra-clean environments. Critical for infection control and regulatory compliance.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,imaging_integration_type,imaging_integration_type,Imaging Integration Type,STRING,,,,none|c_arm|intraoperative_mri|intraoperative_ct|fluoroscopy|hybrid_angio,master_data,Type of intraoperative imaging equipment integrated into the OR suite. Hybrid ORs combine surgical and interventional radiology capabilities. C-arm fluoroscopy is common in orthopedic and spine procedures. Intraoperative MRI/CT enable real-time image-guided neurosurgery.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,isolation_capable_flag,isolation_capable_flag,Isolation Capable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the OR can be configured for airborne or contact isolation procedures (e.g., negative pressure for tuberculosis cases, enhanced PPE protocols for infectious diseases). Critical for infection control and pandemic preparedness.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,laminar_airflow_class,laminar_airflow_class,Laminar Airflow Cleanroom Classification (ISO),STRING,,,,iso_5|iso_6|iso_7|iso_8|standard,master_data,"ISO 14644-1 cleanroom classification for the operating room air quality. ISO Class 5 (Class 100) is the highest standard for ultra-clean orthopedic and implant surgeries. ISO Class 7 (Class 10,000) is typical for general surgery. Laminar airflow reduces surgical site infection (SSI) risk.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,last_accreditation_survey_date,last_accreditation_survey_date,Last Accreditation Survey Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date of the most recent accreditation survey or inspection for the surgical services program. Used to track compliance cycles and prepare for upcoming surveys.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,last_maintenance_date,last_maintenance_date,Last Maintenance Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date of the most recent completed preventive maintenance or deep cleaning cycle for the OR suite. Used to track compliance with maintenance schedules and regulatory requirements.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,last_updated_timestamp,last_updated_timestamp,Record Last Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,"Date and time when this OR suite record was most recently modified. Used for audit trail, change tracking, and data quality monitoring.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,license_expiration_date,license_expiration_date,License Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Expiration date of the facility license for this OR suite. Alerts compliance teams to renew licenses before expiration to avoid regulatory penalties or loss of reimbursement eligibility.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,license_number,license_number,Facility License Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,State or local regulatory license number for the operating room suite. Required for Medicare/Medicaid reimbursement and state health department inspections. Tracked per OR or per facility depending on jurisdiction.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,medical_gas_outlets_count,medical_gas_outlets_count,Medical Gas Outlets Count,INT,,,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii",,master_data,"Total number of medical gas outlets (oxygen, nitrous oxide, medical air, vacuum, WAGD) installed in the OR suite. Minimum outlet counts are specified by FGI guidelines based on OR type and size.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,next_accreditation_survey_due_date,next_accreditation_survey_due_date,Next Accreditation Survey Due Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Scheduled or estimated date for the next accreditation survey. Alerts quality and compliance teams to prepare documentation and conduct internal readiness assessments.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,next_maintenance_due_date,next_maintenance_due_date,Next Maintenance Due Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Scheduled date for the next preventive maintenance cycle. Alerts facility management and surgical scheduling teams to plan around maintenance downtime.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,operational_status,operational_status,Operational Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive|maintenance|renovation|decommissioned,master_data,"Current operational state of the OR suite. Active ORs are available for surgical scheduling. Inactive ORs are temporarily unavailable (e.g., equipment failure, staffing shortage). Maintenance and renovation statuses block scheduling for planned downtime. Decommissioned ORs are permanently closed.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,or_name,or_name,Operating Room (OR) Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Descriptive name for the operating room suite, may include location or specialty designation (e.g., Main OR 5, Cardiac Surgery Suite A, Hybrid OR West Wing).",
facility,site_management,or_suite,or_number,or_number,Operating Room (OR) Number,STRING,,,,"^OR[0-9]{1,4}$",master_data,"Business identifier for the operating room suite, typically displayed as OR1, OR2, OR10, etc. Used in surgical scheduling systems like Epic OpTime and Cerner SurgiNet.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,or_type,or_type,Operating Room (OR) Type,STRING,,,,general|cardiac|orthopedic|neurosurgery|hybrid|endoscopy,master_data,"Classification of the operating room by surgical specialty or capability. Determines equipment requirements, staffing models, and scheduling rules. General ORs support multiple specialties; specialized ORs are configured for specific procedures.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,pediatric_capable_flag,pediatric_capable_flag,Pediatric Capable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the OR is equipped and staffed to support pediatric surgical cases. Requires specialized equipment (pediatric anesthesia circuits, warming devices, smaller instruments) and trained perioperative staff.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,positive_pressure_maintained_flag,positive_pressure_maintained_flag,Positive Pressure Maintained Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the OR maintains positive air pressure relative to adjacent corridors and support spaces. Positive pressure prevents contaminated air from entering the sterile field. Required for most ORs; negative pressure is used only for airborne isolation procedures.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,robotic_surgery_compatible_flag,robotic_surgery_compatible_flag,Robotic Surgery Compatible Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the OR suite is configured and equipped to support robotic-assisted surgical systems (e.g., da Vinci Surgical System). Requires additional space, power, and structural support.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,room_height_feet,room_height_feet,Room Height in Feet,"DECIMAL(6,2)",,,,,master_data,"Ceiling height of the operating room in feet. Critical for surgical light placement, boom configuration, and laminar airflow system design.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,room_length_feet,room_length_feet,Room Length in Feet,"DECIMAL(6,2)",,,,,master_data,"Physical length dimension of the operating room in feet. Used for space planning, equipment placement, and compliance with facility design standards.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,room_width_feet,room_width_feet,Room Width in Feet,"DECIMAL(6,2)",,,,,master_data,Physical width dimension of the operating room in feet. Minimum dimensions are regulated for different OR types to ensure safe equipment access and staff movement.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,scheduled_maintenance_window,scheduled_maintenance_window,Scheduled Maintenance Window,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Recurring time block reserved for preventive maintenance, deep cleaning, and equipment calibration (e.g., Every Sunday 6:00 AM - 12:00 PM, First Monday of month). OR is unavailable for surgical scheduling during this window.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,status_effective_timestamp,status_effective_timestamp,Status Effective Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Date and time when the current operational status became effective. Used to track OR availability history and calculate downtime metrics for capacity management.,
facility,site_management,or_suite,status_reason_code,status_reason_code,Status Reason Code,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Coded reason for the current operational status (e.g., EQUIP_FAIL for equipment failure, STAFF_SHORT for staffing shortage, SCHED_MAINT for scheduled maintenance, RENO for renovation). Supports root cause analysis of OR unavailability.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,surgical_table_type,surgical_table_type,Surgical Table Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Model or type of the primary surgical table installed in the OR (e.g., general surgery table, orthopedic fracture table, neurosurgery head frame table, robotic surgery table). Table type determines compatible procedures and patient positioning capabilities.",
facility,site_management,or_suite,video_integration_capability_flag,video_integration_capability_flag,Video Integration Capability Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the OR has integrated video capture, recording, and display systems for endoscopic, laparoscopic, or robotic surgery. Supports surgical education, quality review, and telemedicine consultation.",
facility,site_management,organization,organization_id,organization_id,,BIGINT,Y,,,,,description,
facility,site_management,organization,care_site_id,care_site_id,,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,,FK to facility.care_site anchoring this organization to the facility hierarchy,
facility,site_management,organization,parent_organization_id,parent_organization_id,,BIGINT,,facility.organization.organization_id,"FK_self_ref,parent_organization_id=BIGINT",,,Self-referential FK to facility.organization.organization_id enabling health system hierarchy (system → hospital → clinic → department → unit),
facility,site_management,room,room_id,room_id,Room Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the room. Primary key for the room entity.,
facility,site_management,room,care_site_id,care_site_id,Facility Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,master_data,Reference to the parent facility or hospital where this room is located. Links to the facility master data.,
facility,site_management,room,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,master_data,Reference to the financial cost center to which room occupancy and maintenance costs are allocated. Supports revenue cycle management and financial reporting.,
facility,site_management,room,unit_id,unit_id,Unit Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.unit.unit_id,,,master_data,Reference to the parent unit or department within the facility where this room is located. Links to the unit master data.,
facility,site_management,room,workforce_org_unit_id,workforce_org_unit_id,Assigned Department Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.org_unit.org_unit_id,,,master_data,"Reference to the clinical department or service line that has primary operational responsibility for this room. Used for scheduling, cost allocation, and resource management.",
facility,site_management,room,accreditation_status,accreditation_status,Accreditation Status,STRING,,,,accredited|provisional|not_accredited|pending,master_data,"Current accreditation status of the room by relevant accrediting bodies (e.g., The Joint Commission, AAAHC). Impacts operational authorization and reimbursement eligibility.",
facility,site_management,room,active_flag,active_flag,Active Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the room is currently active and available for use in operational systems. Supports soft-delete patterns and historical record retention.,
facility,site_management,room,ada_compliant_flag,ada_compliant_flag,Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Compliant Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the room meets ADA accessibility requirements for patients and staff with disabilities. Required for regulatory compliance and patient access.,
facility,site_management,room,bariatric_capable_flag,bariatric_capable_flag,Bariatric Capable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the room is equipped and structurally reinforced to accommodate bariatric patients (typically over 350 lbs). Includes specialized beds, lifts, and wider doorways.",
facility,site_management,room,bed_count,bed_count,Bed Count,INT,,,,,master_data,"Number of patient beds or stretchers that can be accommodated in the room. Used for bed management, capacity planning, and CMS reporting.",
facility,site_management,room,boom_configuration,boom_configuration,Boom Configuration,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of ceiling-mounted equipment boom configuration in the room (e.g., single boom, dual boom, articulating arm). Relevant for OR and ICU rooms with suspended equipment.",
facility,site_management,room,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when the room record was first created in the system. Audit trail for data lineage and compliance.,
facility,site_management,room,effective_from_date,effective_from_date,Effective From Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,"Date from which the current room configuration, assignment, or status became effective. Supports temporal tracking and historical analysis.",
facility,site_management,room,effective_to_date,effective_to_date,Effective To Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,"Date until which the current room configuration, assignment, or status is valid. Null indicates current/active record. Supports temporal tracking and historical analysis.",
facility,site_management,room,emergency_power_flag,emergency_power_flag,Emergency Power Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the room is connected to emergency backup power systems. Critical for life-safety equipment in ORs, ICUs, and emergency departments.",
facility,site_management,room,hand_hygiene_station_count,hand_hygiene_station_count,Hand Hygiene Station Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of hand hygiene stations (sinks or alcohol-based hand rub dispensers) in the room. Critical for infection prevention compliance and Joint Commission accreditation.,
facility,site_management,room,hvac_air_exchange_rate,hvac_air_exchange_rate,Heating Ventilation and Air Conditioning (HVAC) Air Exchange Rate,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,"Number of complete air changes per hour (ACH) provided by the HVAC system. Critical for infection control, OR sterility, and regulatory compliance per ASHRAE 170.",
facility,site_management,room,imaging_integration_flag,imaging_integration_flag,Imaging Integration Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the room has integrated imaging equipment (e.g., C-arm, fluoroscopy, intraoperative CT/MRI). Common in hybrid ORs and interventional procedure rooms.",
facility,site_management,room,isolation_capable_flag,isolation_capable_flag,Isolation Capable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the room is equipped and certified for isolation of infectious patients. Critical for infection prevention and control workflows.,
facility,site_management,room,last_deep_clean_date,last_deep_clean_date,Last Deep Clean Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,"Date of the most recent terminal or deep cleaning of the room. Used for infection prevention tracking, environmental services scheduling, and outbreak investigation.",
facility,site_management,room,last_inspection_date,last_inspection_date,Last Inspection Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date of the most recent regulatory or safety inspection of the room. Used for compliance tracking and accreditation readiness.,
facility,site_management,room,last_modified_timestamp,last_modified_timestamp,Last Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when the room record was last updated. Audit trail for data lineage and change tracking.,
facility,site_management,room,lease_ownership_indicator,lease_ownership_indicator,Lease Ownership Indicator,STRING,,,,owned|leased|shared|contracted,master_data,"Indicates whether the room space is owned by the organization, leased from a third party, shared with another entity, or contracted. Impacts financial reporting and cost allocation.",
facility,site_management,room,license_number,license_number,License Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,"State or regulatory license number for the room, if applicable (e.g., for surgical suites, radiology rooms). Required for compliance and accreditation tracking.",
facility,site_management,room,medical_air_outlet_count,medical_air_outlet_count,Medical Air Outlet Count,INT,,,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii",,master_data,Number of medical air outlets for compressed air delivery. Used for respiratory therapy and surgical equipment.,
facility,site_management,room,monthly_space_cost,monthly_space_cost,Monthly Space Cost,"DECIMAL(12,2)",,,dbx_confidential,,master_data,"Allocated monthly cost for the room space, including lease payments, depreciation, utilities, and maintenance. Used for cost center chargebacks and financial analysis.",
facility,site_management,room,negative_pressure_flag,negative_pressure_flag,Negative Pressure Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the room has negative pressure ventilation to prevent airborne pathogen spread. Required for airborne isolation (e.g., tuberculosis, COVID-19).",
facility,site_management,room,next_scheduled_maintenance_date,next_scheduled_maintenance_date,Next Scheduled Maintenance Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date of the next planned preventive maintenance activity for the room or its equipment. Supports biomedical engineering and facilities management workflows.,
facility,site_management,room,nitrous_oxide_outlet_count,nitrous_oxide_outlet_count,Nitrous Oxide (N2O) Outlet Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of nitrous oxide gas outlets. Typically present in operating rooms and dental procedure rooms for anesthesia delivery.,
facility,site_management,room,nurse_call_system_flag,nurse_call_system_flag,Nurse Call System Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the room is equipped with a nurse call system for patient-to-staff communication. Standard for patient rooms and required for CMS compliance.,
facility,site_management,room,occupancy_percentage,occupancy_percentage,Occupancy Percentage,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,Calculated percentage of time the room is occupied over a reporting period. Key performance indicator for space utilization and capacity management.,
facility,site_management,room,or_airflow_class,or_airflow_class,Operating Room (OR) Airflow Class,STRING,,,,iso_5|iso_6|iso_7|iso_8|standard,master_data,ISO cleanroom classification for operating room air quality and particulate control. Defines laminar airflow requirements for surgical sterility. Applicable only to OR rooms.,
facility,site_management,room,oxygen_outlet_count,oxygen_outlet_count,Oxygen (O2) Outlet Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of medical gas outlets for oxygen delivery. Essential for patient care capacity planning and emergency preparedness.,
facility,site_management,room,room_class,room_class,Room Class,STRING,,,,private|semi_private|ward|suite|isolation|observation,master_data,"Classification of the room based on occupancy and privacy level. Impacts billing, patient preference, and infection control protocols.",
facility,site_management,room,room_name,room_name,Room Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Human-readable name or description of the room, often used for scheduling and communication (e.g., Cardiac Cath Lab 1, Pediatric Exam Room B).",
facility,site_management,room,room_number,room_number,Room Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The official room number or identifier used for wayfinding, signage, and operational reference. May include alphanumeric codes (e.g., 3A-201, OR-5, ICU-12).",
facility,site_management,room,room_status,room_status,Room Status,STRING,,,,available|occupied|cleaning|out_of_service|maintenance|reserved,master_data,"Current operational status of the room. Drives bed management, ADT workflows, and scheduling availability.",
facility,site_management,room,room_type,room_type,Room Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Classification of the room based on its primary clinical or operational function. Determines equipment requirements, staffing, and scheduling rules. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: patient|operating_room|procedure_room|exam_room|consultation_room|support_room|isolation_room|negative_pressure_room — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
facility,site_management,room,square_footage,square_footage,Square Footage,"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,master_data,"Total floor area of the room measured in square feet. Used for space utilization analysis, cost allocation, and compliance with facility design standards.",
facility,site_management,room,telemetry_capable_flag,telemetry_capable_flag,Telemetry Capable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the room is equipped with telemetry monitoring infrastructure for continuous cardiac and vital sign monitoring.,
facility,site_management,room,vacuum_outlet_count,vacuum_outlet_count,Vacuum Outlet Count,INT,,,,,master_data,"Number of medical vacuum outlets for suctioning. Required for surgical, procedural, and critical care rooms.",
facility,site_management,room,ventilator_outlet_count,ventilator_outlet_count,Ventilator Outlet Count,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of electrical outlets dedicated to ventilator equipment. Critical for ICU and critical care room planning and patient placement.,
facility,site_management,site_hierarchy,site_hierarchy_id,site_hierarchy_id,Site Hierarchy Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the site hierarchy node within the integrated delivery network (IDN). Primary key.,
