interoperability,exchange_network,patient_identity_match,manual_review_required_flag,manual_review_required_flag,Manual Review Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether the match result requires manual review by HIM staff due to ambiguous or low-confidence matching (True=manual review required, False=automated match accepted).",
