interoperability,exchange_network,patient_identity_match,match_method,match_method,Match Method,STRING,,,,DETERMINISTIC|PROBABILISTIC|HYBRID|MANUAL,transactional_data,"Method used to perform the patient identity match (DETERMINISTIC=exact match on key identifiers, PROBABILISTIC=statistical matching, HYBRID=combination, MANUAL=human review).",
