interoperability,exchange_network,patient_identity_match,match_score,match_score,Match Score,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"Numerical score representing the confidence level of the patient identity match, typically expressed as a percentage or weighted score. Higher scores indicate stronger matches.",
