interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,quality_measure_id,quality_measure_id,Quality Measure Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,quality.measure.measure_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to quality.measure. Business justification: Public health reports (immunization registry submissions, syndromic surveillance, cancer registry) often satisfy quality measure numerators (e.g., HEDIS childhood immunization, CMS immunization measur",
