interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,error_description,error_description,Error Description,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Detailed description of any errors, validation failures, or rejection reasons returned by the receiving public health agency. Populated when submission_status is rejected or error.",
interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,jurisdiction_code,jurisdiction_code,Reporting Jurisdiction Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Code identifying the state, county, or local public health jurisdiction to which this report is being submitted. Typically a FIPS code or state abbreviation.",
interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,message_payload,message_payload,Message Payload,STRING,,,dbx_confidential,,transactional_data,"Full text of the transmitted public health message in its native format (HL7 v2 pipe-delimited message, FHIR JSON bundle, CDA XML document). Stored for audit, troubleshooting, and resubmission purposes.",
interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Record Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,"Date and time when this public health report record was last updated in the data warehouse. Audit timestamp for tracking changes to submission status, acknowledgments, or retry attempts.",
interoperability,exchange_network,public_health_report,patient_mrn,patient_mrn,Medical Record Number (MRN),STRING,,,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,transactional_data,"Medical record number of the patient associated with this public health report, if the report pertains to a single patient. For batch submissions covering multiple patients, this field may be null.",
