interoperability,integration_engine,interface_channel,channel_type,channel_type,Interface Channel Type,STRING,,,,inbound|outbound|bidirectional,master_data,"Directional classification of the interface channel indicating whether it receives data (inbound), sends data (outbound), or supports both directions (bidirectional).",
