laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,consent_record_id,consent_record_id,Consent Record Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,consent.consent_consent_record.consent_record_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to consent.consent_record. Business justification: Results disclosure for genetic tests, HIV, substance abuse screening requires consent verification before release. Patient portal access to sensitive lab results, results sharing with third parties, a",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to finance.cost_center. Business justification: Test results represent completed work that must be costed to the performing lab sections cost center for cost-per-test analysis, budget variance reporting, and Medicare cost report Schedule D prepara",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,demographics_id,demographics_id,Patient Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,patient.demographics.demographics_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the patient for whom this test was performed. Links to the master patient record.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,diagnosis_icd_code_id,diagnosis_icd_code_id,Diagnosis Icd Code Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,reference.icd_code.icd_code_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_health",,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to reference.icd_code. Business justification: Test results linked to diagnosis codes enable outcomes tracking, quality measure calculation (e.g., HbA1c results for diabetes patients), and clinical correlation analysis. Required for value-based ca",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,employee_id,employee_id,,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,,,transactional_data,FK to workforce.employee.employee_id,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,instrument_id,instrument_id,Laboratory Instrument Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,laboratory.instrument.instrument_id,,,transactional_data,"Identifier of the laboratory instrument or analyzer that produced the result. Used for quality control, calibration tracking, and troubleshooting.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,lab_order_id,lab_order_id,Laboratory Order Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,laboratory.lab_order.lab_order_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the parent laboratory order that requested this test. Links to the clinical order that initiated the test.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,laboratory_employee_id,laboratory_employee_id,Verifying Technologist Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,Reference to the laboratory technologist or medical technologist who verified and released the result. Required for CLIA compliance and quality assurance.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,loinc_code_id,loinc_code_id,Loinc Code Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,reference.loinc_code.loinc_code_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to reference.loinc_code. Business justification: Test results require LOINC linkage for standardized result reporting, HIE exchange, quality measure calculation, and clinical decision support. Enables semantic interoperability for result interpretat",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,mpi_record_id,mpi_record_id,,BIGINT,,patient.mpi_record.mpi_record_id,,,transactional_data,description,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,performing_lab_care_site_id,performing_lab_care_site_id,,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,transactional_data,FK to facility.care_site.care_site_id,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,primary_test_clinician_id,primary_test_clinician_id,Verifying Pathologist Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,"Reference to the pathologist who reviewed and verified the result, particularly for complex tests requiring physician oversight. Required for certain test categories under CLIA.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,quality_measure_id,quality_measure_id,Quality Measure Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,quality.measure.measure_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to quality.measure. Business justification: Lab test results are core data elements for clinical quality measures (CQMs/eCQMs). Measure calculation engines query lab results by measure_id to determine numerator compliance for quality reporting ,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,reagent_lot_id,reagent_lot_id,Reagent Lot Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,laboratory.reagent_lot.reagent_lot_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to laboratory.reagent_lot. Business justification: Test results should track reagent lots used for traceability. Currently no FK exists. Business reality: result traceability requires linking to the specific reagent lot used in testing, critical for i",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,reference_range_id,reference_range_id,Reference Range Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,laboratory.reference_range.reference_range_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to laboratory.reference_range. Business justification: Test results are interpreted using reference ranges. Currently test_result has reference_range_low/high/text embedded. Business reality: reference ranges are applied to results for interpretation and ,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,research_study_id,research_study_id,Research Study Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,research.research_study.research_study_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to research.research_study. Business justification: Test results from research subjects must link to study for protocol endpoint assessment, safety monitoring, data analysis, and regulatory submissions. Essential for clinical trial data management and ",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_snomed_concept_id,result_snomed_concept_id,Result Snomed Concept Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,reference.snomed_concept.snomed_concept_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to reference.snomed_concept. Business justification: Test results with coded values require SNOMED CT linkage for semantic interoperability and clinical decision support. The result_value_coded field needs structured terminology; proper FK enables autom,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,specimen_id,specimen_id,Specimen Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,laboratory.specimen.specimen_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the specimen from which this test result was derived. Links to the specimen collection and tracking record.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,tertiary_employee_id,tertiary_employee_id,Amending User Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,Reference to the laboratory professional or system user who performed the result amendment. Required for accountability and audit purposes.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,tertiary_test_ordering_provider_clinician_id,tertiary_test_ordering_provider_clinician_id,Ordering Provider Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the provider who ordered the laboratory test. Used for result routing and clinical communication.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,test_catalog_id,test_catalog_id,Test Catalog Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,laboratory.test_catalog.test_catalog_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to laboratory.test_catalog. Business justification: Test results are instances of tests defined in the catalog. Currently test_result has loinc_code/loinc_display_name but no FK to test_catalog. Business reality: every result is for a cataloged test. A,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,visit_id,visit_id,Visit Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,encounter.visit.visit_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the clinical encounter or visit during which this test was ordered or resulted. Links to the visit record.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,abnormal_flag,abnormal_flag,Abnormal Flag Indicator,STRING,,,,normal|low|high|critical_low|critical_high|abnormal,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether the result falls outside the normal reference range. Values include normal, low, high, critical_low, critical_high, or abnormal for non-numeric results.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,amendment_datetime,amendment_datetime,Result Amendment Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the result was amended or corrected. Critical for audit trail and understanding result history.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,amendment_reason,amendment_reason,Result Amendment Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Documented reason for amending or correcting the result (e.g., transcription error, instrument malfunction, specimen mix-up, calculation error). Required for CLIA compliance.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,clia_number,clia_number,Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments (CLIA) Number,STRING,,,,^[0-9]{2}D[0-9]{7}$,transactional_data,CLIA certification number of the laboratory that performed the test. Federally required identifier for all clinical laboratories performing testing on human specimens.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,created_datetime,created_datetime,Record Created Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this test result record was first created in the system. Audit timestamp for data lineage and compliance.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_acknowledgment_datetime,critical_value_acknowledgment_datetime,Critical Value Acknowledgment Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the provider acknowledged receipt and understanding of the critical value. Completes the critical value notification loop.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_alert_generated_datetime,critical_value_alert_generated_datetime,Critical Value Alert Generated Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the critical value alert was generated by the Laboratory Information System (LIS). Marks the start of the critical value notification workflow.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_escalation_action,critical_value_escalation_action,Critical Value Escalation Action,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Description of escalation actions taken if initial notification was unsuccessful (e.g., contacted backup provider, notified charge nurse, paged on-call physician).",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_notification_datetime,critical_value_notification_datetime,Critical Value Notification Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the critical value notification was successfully delivered to the provider. Used to calculate notification turnaround time.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_notification_method,critical_value_notification_method,Critical Value Notification Method,STRING,,,,phone|secure_message|ehr_alert|page|fax|in_person,transactional_data,"Method used to notify the provider of the critical value (e.g., phone, secure message, EHR alert, page). Required for compliance documentation.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,critical_value_resolution_note,critical_value_resolution_note,Critical Value Resolution Note,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text note documenting the resolution of the critical value alert, including any clinical actions taken or follow-up orders placed.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,is_amended,is_amended,Result Amended Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether this result has been amended or corrected after initial release. Triggers amendment tracking and notification workflows.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,is_critical_value,is_critical_value,Critical Value Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether this result exceeds critical thresholds requiring immediate clinical notification. Triggers critical value alert workflow.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,last_updated_datetime,last_updated_datetime,Record Last Updated Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this test result record was last modified. Audit timestamp for tracking changes and data quality.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,original_result_value_numeric,original_result_value_numeric,Original Numeric Result Value,"DECIMAL(18,6)",,,,,transactional_data,Original numeric result value before amendment or correction. Preserved for audit trail and compliance purposes.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,original_result_value_text,original_result_value_text,Original Text Result Value,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Original text result value before amendment or correction. Preserved for audit trail and compliance purposes.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,performing_lab_facility,performing_lab_facility,Performing Laboratory Facility,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Name or identifier of the laboratory facility that performed the test. May be internal lab or external reference lab. Required for CLIA compliance.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,performing_lab_section,performing_lab_section,Performing Laboratory Section,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Laboratory section or department that performed the test (e.g., Chemistry, Hematology, Microbiology, Pathology). Used for operational tracking and quality control.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_comment,result_comment,Result Comment or Note,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Additional comments, notes, or observations about the test result. May include technical notes, specimen quality issues, or other relevant information.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_datetime,result_datetime,Result Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the laboratory test result was produced or finalized. Represents the official result timestamp for clinical and regulatory purposes.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_interpretation,result_interpretation,Result Clinical Interpretation,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Clinical interpretation or commentary provided by the laboratory professional regarding the result. May include clinical significance, recommendations, or contextual notes.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_released_datetime,result_released_datetime,Result Released Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the result was officially released from the laboratory and made available to clinicians. Used for turnaround time calculations.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_status,result_status,Result Status Lifecycle,STRING,,,,preliminary|final|corrected|cancelled|entered_in_error,transactional_data,"Current lifecycle status of the test result. Tracks progression from preliminary through final, and captures corrections or cancellations. Critical for clinical decision-making and compliance.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_unit,result_unit,Result Unit of Measure,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Unit of measure for the numeric result value (e.g., mg/dL, mmol/L, cells/uL). Critical for clinical interpretation and comparison against reference ranges.",
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_value_coded,result_value_coded,Coded Result Value,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Standardized coded value for the test result using terminology systems such as SNOMED CT. Enables structured data exchange and analytics.,
laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,result_value_numeric,result_value_numeric,Numeric Result Value,"DECIMAL(18,6)",,,,,transactional_data,Numeric value of the laboratory test result for quantitative tests. Stores the measured value with precision appropriate for clinical decision-making.,
