laboratory,order_processing,laboratory_test_result,specimen_received_datetime,specimen_received_datetime,Specimen Received Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the specimen was received in the laboratory. Used for tracking specimen handling and turnaround time metrics.,
