laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,clinical_order_id,clinical_order_id,Order ID,BIGINT,,order.clinical_order.clinical_order_id,,,transactional_data,"Identifier of the clinical order that authorized this point-of-care test, if applicable. May be null for standing orders or protocol-driven tests.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,clinician_id,clinician_id,Ordering Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,"Identifier of the provider who ordered the point-of-care test, if applicable.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to finance.cost_center. Business justification: POC tests must be charged to the performing locations cost center for decentralized testing cost tracking, CLIA waived test cost analysis, and departmental budget management. Critical for POC program",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,demographics_id,demographics_id,Patient ID,BIGINT,,patient.demographics.demographics_id,,,transactional_data,Identifier of the patient for whom the point-of-care test was performed. Links to the patient master.,
