laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,material_master_id,material_master_id,Material Master Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,supply.material_master.material_master_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to supply.material_master. Business justification: POC test cartridges, strips, and consumables are material master items. Linking enables usage tracking, automated reordering, cost-per-test calculation, and compliance with CLIA waived testing supply ",
