laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,previous_result_point_of_care_test_id,previous_result_point_of_care_test_id,Previous Result ID,BIGINT,,laboratory.point_of_care_test.point_of_care_test_id,,,transactional_data,"Identifier of the previous point-of-care test result that this record corrects or replaces, if applicable.",
