laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,reagent_lot_id,reagent_lot_id,Reagent Lot Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,laboratory.reagent_lot.reagent_lot_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to laboratory.reagent_lot. Business justification: POC tests use reagent lots (test strips, cartridges). Currently point_of_care_test has reagent_lot_number (string) and reagent_expiration_date but no FK. Business reality: POC testing requires reagent",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,test_catalog_id,test_catalog_id,Test Catalog Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,laboratory.test_catalog.test_catalog_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to laboratory.test_catalog. Business justification: POC tests are instances of catalog tests performed at point of care. Currently point_of_care_test has test_code/loinc_code/test_name but no FK. Business reality: POC tests are catalog tests with speci,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,visit_id,visit_id,Encounter ID,BIGINT,,encounter.visit.visit_id,,,transactional_data,Identifier of the clinical encounter or visit during which the point-of-care test was performed.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,abnormal_flag,abnormal_flag,Abnormal Flag,STRING,,,,normal|low|high|critical_low|critical_high|abnormal,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether the result is within normal range, abnormal, or critically abnormal. Used for clinical alerting.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,clia_waived_flag,clia_waived_flag,Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments (CLIA) Waived Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean indicator of whether this test is CLIA-waived (simple tests with low risk of error) or non-waived (moderate/high complexity).,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,collection_datetime,collection_datetime,Collection Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,"Date and time when the specimen was collected for the test, if different from test performance time.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,corrected_result_flag,corrected_result_flag,Corrected Result Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean indicator of whether this result is a correction of a previously reported result. Supports audit trail and clinical safety.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this point-of-care test record was first created in the system. Audit trail field.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,critical_value_flag,critical_value_flag,Critical Value Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean indicator of whether this result represents a critical value requiring immediate clinical notification per facility policy.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,device_type,device_type,Device Type,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Type or category of the point-of-care testing device used for the test. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: glucometer|istat|coaguchek|rapid_strep|influenza|urine_dipstick|blood_gas|pregnancy|troponin|other — 10 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,ehr_transmission_datetime,ehr_transmission_datetime,Electronic Health Record (EHR) Transmission Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the test result was successfully transmitted to the EHR system.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,ehr_transmission_status,ehr_transmission_status,Electronic Health Record (EHR) Transmission Status,STRING,,,,transmitted|pending|failed|not_required,transactional_data,Status of the result transmission from the point-of-care device to the electronic health record system.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,mrn,mrn,Medical Record Number (MRN),STRING,,,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,transactional_data,The patients medical record number at the time of the test. Protected health information under HIPAA.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,operator_competency_date,operator_competency_date,Operator Competency Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date when the operators competency for this test type was last assessed and verified.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,operator_competency_status,operator_competency_status,Operator Competency Status,STRING,,,,competent|training|expired|not_assessed,transactional_data,Competency status of the operator for this specific test type at the time of test performance. Required for CLIA compliance.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,operator_name,operator_name,Operator Name,STRING,,,dbx_confidential,,transactional_data,Name of the healthcare worker who performed the point-of-care test. Retained for audit and competency tracking.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,performing_location_name,performing_location_name,Performing Location Name,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Name or description of the location where the point-of-care test was performed.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,qc_datetime,qc_datetime,Quality Control (QC) Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when the most recent quality control check was performed on the device used for this test.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,qc_lot_number,qc_lot_number,Quality Control (QC) Lot Number,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Lot number of the quality control material used for device validation at the time of testing.,
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,qc_status,qc_status,Quality Control (QC) Status,STRING,,,,passed|failed|not_performed|pending,transactional_data,Status of quality control checks performed on the device at or near the time of the patient test. Critical for CLIA compliance.,
