laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,result_unit,result_unit,Result Unit of Measure,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Unit of measure for the numeric result (e.g., mg/dL, mmol/L, seconds, INR). Should align with UCUM standards.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,result_value,result_value,Result Value,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"The measured or observed result value from the point-of-care test. May be numeric, qualitative (positive/negative), or text.",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,specimen_source,specimen_source,Specimen Source,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Anatomical source or collection site of the specimen (e.g., fingerstick, venous, throat).",
