laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,test_status,test_status,Test Status,STRING,,,,preliminary|final|corrected|cancelled|entered_in_error,transactional_data,"Current status of the point-of-care test result in its lifecycle (preliminary, final, corrected, cancelled).",
laboratory,order_processing,point_of_care_test,updated_timestamp,updated_timestamp,Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Date and time when this point-of-care test record was last modified. Audit trail field.,
