laboratory,order_processing,specimen,disposal_method,disposal_method,Disposal Method,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Method used to dispose of the specimen (e.g., biohazard waste, incineration, autoclave). Ensures compliance with safety and environmental regulations.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,fasting_status,fasting_status,Fasting Status,STRING,,,,fasting|non_fasting|unknown,master_data,"Indicates whether the patient was fasting at the time of specimen collection. Critical for interpretation of glucose, lipid, and metabolic tests.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,number_of_aliquots,number_of_aliquots,Number of Aliquots,INT,,,,,master_data,Count of aliquots or sub-specimens created from the original specimen for distribution to different testing sections or for storage.,
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,priority,priority,Specimen Priority,STRING,,,,routine|urgent|stat|asap,master_data,Processing priority level assigned to the specimen. Determines turnaround time expectations and workflow sequencing.,
