laboratory,order_processing,specimen,rejection_reason,rejection_reason,Rejection Reason,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Reason for specimen rejection if not acceptable for testing (e.g., hemolyzed, insufficient quantity, unlabeled, expired). Supports quality improvement and recollection requests.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,retention_expiration_date,retention_expiration_date,Retention Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when the specimen retention period expires and the specimen may be disposed of per laboratory policy.,
