laboratory,order_processing,specimen,special_handling_instructions,special_handling_instructions,Special Handling Instructions,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Any special handling requirements or precautions for the specimen (e.g., keep frozen, protect from light, handle as infectious). Ensures proper specimen management.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,specimen_source,specimen_source,Specimen Source,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Anatomical site or body location from which the specimen was collected (e.g., left antecubital vein, throat, wound site). Provides clinical context for interpretation of test results.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,specimen_type,specimen_type,Specimen Type,STRING,,,,blood|urine|tissue|csf|swab|stool,master_data,"Type of biological specimen collected (e.g., blood, urine, tissue, cerebrospinal fluid, swab, stool). Defines the nature of the material submitted for laboratory analysis.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,storage_location,storage_location,Storage Location,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Physical location where the specimen is currently stored (e.g., refrigerator ID, freezer location, room number). Supports specimen retrieval and inventory management.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,storage_temperature_c,storage_temperature_c,Storage Temperature (Celsius),"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,"Temperature at which the specimen is stored, measured in degrees Celsius. Critical for specimen stability and quality assurance.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,transport_duration_minutes,transport_duration_minutes,Transport Duration (Minutes),INT,,,,,master_data,"Time elapsed between specimen collection and laboratory receipt, measured in minutes. Critical for time-sensitive analytes and quality assessment.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,transport_temperature_c,transport_temperature_c,Transport Temperature (Celsius),"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,"Temperature at which the specimen was transported from collection site to laboratory, measured in degrees Celsius. Affects specimen stability and quality.",
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,updated_datetime,updated_datetime,Record Updated Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Date and time when this specimen record was last modified. Supports audit trail and change tracking.,
laboratory,order_processing,specimen,volume_collected_ml,volume_collected_ml,Volume Collected (Milliliters),"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,master_data,"Volume of specimen collected, measured in milliliters. Used to determine test feasibility and aliquot planning.",
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,study_test_requirement_id,study_test_requirement_id,Study Test Requirement ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,association_data,Unique identifier for this study test requirement record. Primary key.,
