laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,collection_timepoint,collection_timepoint,Collection Timepoint,STRING,,,,,association_data,"The protocol-defined timepoint or visit at which this test must be collected (e.g., screening, baseline, day_1, week_4, month_6, end_of_treatment). Maps to the protocol visit schedule.",
