laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,protocol_amendment_number,protocol_amendment_number,Protocol Amendment Number,STRING,,,,,association_data,The protocol amendment number that introduced or modified this test requirement. Links to the research_study protocol amendment tracking.,
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,protocol_required_flag,protocol_required_flag,Protocol Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether this test is mandated by the research protocol (true) or optional/conditional (false). Used for protocol compliance monitoring.,
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,requirement_status,requirement_status,Requirement Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Current status of this test requirement in the protocol. Allows for protocol amendments that add, remove, or modify test requirements without deleting historical records.",
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,sponsor_covered_flag,sponsor_covered_flag,Sponsor Covered Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether the study sponsor covers the cost of this test (true) or if it should be billed to patient insurance (false). Used for billing and budget management.,
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,standard_of_care_flag,standard_of_care_flag,Standard of Care Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether this test is considered standard-of-care (true) or research-only (false). Critical for coverage analysis and billing determination.,
laboratory,order_processing,study_test_requirement,visit_schedule,visit_schedule,Visit Schedule,STRING,,,,,association_data,"The visit schedule or visit window during which this test should be performed, including acceptable timing windows (e.g., Week 4 ±3 days, Monthly ±7 days). Used for visit planning and scheduling.",
laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,test_catalog_id,test_catalog_id,Test Catalog Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,reference_data,Unique identifier for the laboratory test catalog entry. Primary key for the test catalog product.,
