laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,quality_measure_id,quality_measure_id,Quality Measure Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,quality.measure.measure_id,,,reference_data,"Foreign key linking to quality.measure. Business justification: Test catalog entries map to quality measures requiring specific tests (HbA1c for diabetes measures, lipid panel for cardiovascular measures). Quality measure specifications reference test codes from t",
