laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,authorization_required_flag,authorization_required_flag,Prior Authorization Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,Indicates whether payer prior authorization is typically required before performing this test due to cost or medical necessity criteria. Supports revenue cycle management.,
laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,clia_complexity,clia_complexity,Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments (CLIA) Complexity Level,STRING,,,,waived|moderate|high,reference_data,"CLIA complexity classification of the test: waived (simple, low risk), moderate complexity, or high complexity. Determines regulatory requirements and personnel qualifications.",
laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,clinical_indication,clinical_indication,Clinical Indication,STRING,,,,,reference_data,"Primary clinical use case, indication, or purpose for ordering this test. Supports clinical decision support and appropriate test utilization.",
