laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,consent_required_flag,consent_required_flag,Informed Consent Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,"Indicates whether informed patient consent is required before performing this test (e.g., genetic testing, HIV testing, research testing). Supports regulatory compliance and patient rights.",
laboratory,order_processing,test_catalog,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,reference_data,Timestamp when this test catalog entry was first created in the system. Supports audit trail and historical tracking.,
