laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,copay_amount,copay_amount,Copay Amount,DECIMAL,,,,,association_data,Fixed copayment amount required for this test under this policy. Test-specific copay that may differ from general policy copay structure.,
laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,coverage_determination,coverage_determination,Coverage Determination,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Final determination of whether this specific test is covered, not covered, conditionally covered, or considered investigational/experimental under this policy. Test-specific coverage status.",
laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,coverage_notes,coverage_notes,Coverage Notes,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Additional notes or special instructions specific to the coverage of this test under this policy. May include clinical documentation requirements, billing notes, or special authorization procedures.",
laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,coverage_percentage,coverage_percentage,Coverage Percentage,DECIMAL,,,,,association_data,"Percentage of the test cost covered by the policy after deductible is met. May vary by test within the same policy (e.g., preventive tests at 100%, diagnostic tests at 80%).",
