laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,frequency_limitations,frequency_limitations,Frequency Limitations,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Limitations on how often this specific test can be performed and reimbursed under this policy (e.g., once per year, once per 90 days, maximum 2 per calendar year). Test-specific frequency rules.",
