laboratory,order_processing,test_coverage_policy,place_of_service_restrictions,place_of_service_restrictions,Place of Service Restrictions,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Restrictions on where this specific test can be performed to be eligible for coverage under this policy (e.g., must be performed at in-network lab, hospital outpatient only). Test-specific location requirements.",
