order,entry_management,reconciliation,reconciliation_method,reconciliation_method,Reconciliation Method,STRING,,,,cpoe|paper|verbal|hybrid,transactional_data,"Method used to perform the reconciliation. CPOE (Computerized Physician Order Entry), paper-based, verbal, or hybrid approach.",
order,entry_management,reconciliation,reconciliation_status,reconciliation_status,Reconciliation Status,STRING,,,,completed|incomplete|in_progress|not_required|deferred,transactional_data,"Current status of the reconciliation process. Completed, incomplete, in progress, not required, or deferred.",
order,entry_management,reconciliation,reconciliation_type,reconciliation_type,Reconciliation Type,STRING,,,,admission|transfer|discharge|pre_procedure|post_procedure|outpatient_visit,transactional_data,"Type of care transition event that triggered the reconciliation process. Admission, transfer, discharge, pre-procedure, post-procedure, or outpatient visit.",
order,entry_management,reconciliation,reconciling_provider_npi,reconciling_provider_npi,Reconciling Provider National Provider Identifier (NPI),STRING,,,,^[0-9]{10}$,transactional_data,National Provider Identifier of the clinician who performed the medication reconciliation. Ten-digit unique identifier.,
