order,entry_management,verbal_order,consent_record_id,consent_record_id,Consent Record Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,consent.consent_consent_record.consent_record_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to consent.consent_record. Business justification: Verbal orders in emergencies document whether consent was obtained, waived under emergency exception, or deferred. Emergency treatment documentation workflow links orders to consent status for regulat",
order,entry_management,verbal_order,message_log_id,message_log_id,Source System ID,BIGINT,,interoperability.message_log.message_log_id,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier of the verbal order record in the source operational system. Used for data lineage and reconciliation.,
