order,fulfillment_routing,order_routing,priority_override_flag,priority_override_flag,Priority Override Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether the routing priority was manually overridden by a clinician or supervisor. True if priority was escalated or de-escalated from the original order priority.,
