order,fulfillment_routing,order_routing,rule_name,rule_name,Routing Rule Name,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Human-readable name of the routing rule applied, such as STAT Lab Priority Routing or Radiology Load Balancing Rule.",
order,fulfillment_routing,order_routing,sequence,sequence,Routing Sequence Number,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Sequential number indicating the order of routing events for a single order. Supports tracking of rerouting and escalation workflows.,
order,fulfillment_routing,order_routing,sla_compliance_flag,sla_compliance_flag,Service Level Agreement (SLA) Compliance Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether the routing event met the defined SLA target. True if acknowledgement or completion occurred within the target timeframe.,
order,fulfillment_routing,order_routing,sla_target_minutes,sla_target_minutes,Service Level Agreement (SLA) Target Minutes,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Target turnaround time in minutes from routing to acknowledgement or completion, based on order priority and type. Used for SLA compliance monitoring.",
