order,fulfillment_routing,referral_order,order_authorization_id,order_authorization_id,Payer Authorization ID,BIGINT,,order.order_authorization.order_authorization_id,,,transactional_data,"Reference to the payer prior authorization record associated with this referral, when authorization is required. Links to the encounter authorization entity.",
order,fulfillment_routing,referral_order,payer_id,payer_id,Payer Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,insurance.payer.payer_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to insurance.payer. Business justification: Referral processing requires payer-specific authorization workflows, network validation, and timely filing requirements. Real-world process: referral management systems verify payer requirements, chec",
order,fulfillment_routing,referral_order,primary_referral_clinician_id,primary_referral_clinician_id,Referring Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the clinician who originated and placed the referral order. Typically the patients Primary Care Physician (PCP) or treating provider.,
