order,fulfillment_routing,referral_order,receiving_provider_clinician_id,receiving_provider_clinician_id,Receiving (Specialist) Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the specialist or external provider to whom the patient is being referred. May be null if the receiving provider has not yet been assigned.,
