order,fulfillment_routing,referral_order,research_study_id,research_study_id,Research Study Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,research.research_study.research_study_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to research.research_study. Business justification: Referrals to research studies are common in academic medical centers for patient recruitment. Linking referral to target study supports recruitment metrics tracking, referral source analysis, and stud",
