pharmacy,dispensing_operations,prescription,prescription_date,prescription_date,Prescription Date,DATE,,,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_health",,transactional_data,The date on which the prescription was written by the prescriber. This is the authoritative date for prescription validity and expiration calculations.,
