pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,active_status,active_status,Active Status,STRING,,,,Active|Inactive|Discontinued|Recalled,master_data,"The current lifecycle status of the drug in the organizations drug master, indicating whether it is available for prescribing, dispensing, and administration.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,atc_code,atc_code,Anatomical Therapeutic Chemical (ATC) Classification Code,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The World Health Organizations ATC classification code that categorizes drugs according to the organ or system on which they act and their therapeutic, pharmacological, and chemical properties.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,beyond_use_date_hours,beyond_use_date_hours,Beyond Use Date Hours,INT,,,,,master_data,"The number of hours after opening or preparation that the drug remains safe and effective for use, particularly relevant for compounded or multi-dose preparations.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,black_box_warning_flag,black_box_warning_flag,Black Box Warning Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether the FDA has issued a black box warning (boxed warning) for this drug, signaling serious or life-threatening risks that require prominent disclosure.",
