pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,controlled_substance_indicator,controlled_substance_indicator,Controlled Substance Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether the drug is classified as a controlled substance under DEA regulations, requiring special handling, documentation, and security measures.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,The date and time when this drug master record was first created in the system.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,dea_schedule,dea_schedule,Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA) Schedule,STRING,,,,Schedule I|Schedule II|Schedule III|Schedule IV|Schedule V|Non-Controlled,master_data,The DEA controlled substance schedule classification indicating the drugs potential for abuse and accepted medical use. Schedule I has highest abuse potential with no accepted medical use; Schedule V has lowest abuse potential.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,discontinuation_date,discontinuation_date,Discontinuation Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,The date on which the drug was discontinued from the formulary or removed from active use in the organization.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,discontinuation_reason,discontinuation_reason,Discontinuation Reason,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The business or clinical rationale for discontinuing the drug from the formulary (e.g., Manufacturer Discontinuation, Safety Concern, Cost, Therapeutic Alternative Available).",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,dosage_form,dosage_form,Dosage Form,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The physical form in which the drug is manufactured and dispensed (e.g., Tablet, Capsule, Injection, Solution, Cream, Patch, Inhaler).",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,drug_class,drug_class,Drug Classification,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The pharmacological or therapeutic classification of the drug based on mechanism of action, chemical structure, or therapeutic use (e.g., Beta-Blocker, ACE Inhibitor, NSAID).",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,fda_application_number,fda_application_number,Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Application Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,The FDA-assigned New Drug Application (NDA) or Abbreviated New Drug Application (ANDA) number that uniquely identifies the regulatory submission and approval.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,fda_approval_date,fda_approval_date,Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Approval Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,"The date on which the FDA granted marketing approval for this drug product, establishing its legal authorization for commercial distribution in the United States.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,formulary_status,formulary_status,Formulary Status,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The drugs inclusion status in the organizations formulary, indicating whether it is approved for routine use, requires special authorization, or is preferred based on clinical and cost-effectiveness criteria. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: Formulary|Non-Formulary|Restricted|Preferred|Tier 1|Tier 2|Tier 3 — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,generic_name,generic_name,Generic Drug Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The non-proprietary, scientific name of the active pharmaceutical ingredient as established by the United States Adopted Names (USAN) Council or international nomenclature standards.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,geriatric_dosing_adjustment_flag,geriatric_dosing_adjustment_flag,Geriatric Dosing Adjustment Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Boolean flag indicating whether the drug requires dosing adjustments or special considerations for geriatric patients due to altered pharmacokinetics or increased sensitivity.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,hazardous_drug_flag,hazardous_drug_flag,Hazardous Drug Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether the drug is classified as hazardous per NIOSH criteria, requiring special handling, personal protective equipment, and disposal procedures to protect healthcare workers.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,hepatic_dosing_adjustment_flag,hepatic_dosing_adjustment_flag,Hepatic Dosing Adjustment Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Boolean flag indicating whether the drug requires dosing adjustments for patients with hepatic impairment or liver disease.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,ismp_high_alert_flag,ismp_high_alert_flag,Institute for Safe Medication Practices (ISMP) High-Alert Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether the drug is classified as high-alert by ISMP, meaning it carries heightened risk of causing significant patient harm when used in error.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,lactation_risk_category,lactation_risk_category,Lactation Risk Category,STRING,,,,,master_data,The classification indicating the drugs safety profile for use during breastfeeding and potential risks to nursing infants.,
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,lasa_drug_pairs,lasa_drug_pairs,Look-Alike Sound-Alike (LASA) Drug Pairs,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Comma-separated list of drug names that are commonly confused with this drug due to similar appearance or pronunciation, used for clinical decision support and error prevention.",
pharmacy,medication_catalog,drug_master,lasa_indicator,lasa_indicator,Look-Alike Sound-Alike (LASA) Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether the drug has been identified as having look-alike or sound-alike characteristics with other medications, requiring additional safety measures to prevent confusion.",
