pharmacy,safety_compliance,controlled_substance_log,drug_ndc,drug_ndc,National Drug Code (NDC),STRING,,,,^[0-9]{5}-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}$|^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}$|^[0-9]{5}-[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{2}$,transactional_data,"FDA National Drug Code uniquely identifying the drug product, labeler, and package size. 11-digit code in 5-4-2, 4-4-2, or 5-3-2 format.",
