pharmacy,safety_compliance,controlled_substance_log,quantity,quantity,Transaction Quantity,"DECIMAL(12,3)",,,,,transactional_data,"Quantity of controlled substance involved in the transaction. Positive for additions (transfer_in, return), negative for reductions (dispensing, administration, waste, transfer_out).",
