pharmacy,safety_compliance,controlled_substance_log,waste_reason,waste_reason,Waste Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Reason for controlled substance waste: patient refused, medication error, partial dose unused, expired, contaminated. Null for non-waste transactions.",
pharmacy,safety_compliance,controlled_substance_log,witness_provider_name,witness_provider_name,Witness Provider Name,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Full name of the witnessing healthcare provider for waste transactions. Null if no witness required.,
