pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,drug_master_id,drug_master_id,Drug Master Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,pharmacy.drug_master.drug_master_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to pharmacy.drug_master. Business justification: REMS compliance tracking is for specific drugs requiring FDA-mandated risk mitigation. Cardinality N:1 (many compliance records for one drug). The drug_ndc is kept as its the business key for REMS pr,
pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,employee_id,employee_id,Care Coordinator ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,Reference to the care coordinator or specialty pharmacy case manager assigned to support the patient through the REMS program and specialty medication management. Null if no coordinator assigned.,
