pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,drug_ndc,drug_ndc,National Drug Code (NDC),STRING,,,,"^[0-9]{4,5}-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{1,2}$",transactional_data,The 11-digit National Drug Code identifying the specific medication subject to REMS or specialty program requirements. Format: labeler-product-package.,
pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,enrollment_date,enrollment_date,Program Enrollment Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date the patient was enrolled in the REMS or specialty pharmacy program.,
pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,enrollment_status,enrollment_status,Enrollment Status,STRING,,,,Active|Pending|Inactive|Withdrawn|Suspended|Completed,transactional_data,"Current status of the patients enrollment in the program: active (fully enrolled and compliant), pending (enrollment in progress), inactive (not currently enrolled), withdrawn (patient withdrew), suspended (temporarily paused), or completed (program requirements fulfilled).",
pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,fda_reporting_required,fda_reporting_required,FDA Reporting Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether this REMS compliance record requires reporting to the FDA as part of the REMS program assessment. True if FDA reporting is required; false if not required.,
