pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,lab_monitoring_required,lab_monitoring_required,Laboratory Monitoring Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether the REMS program mandates periodic laboratory testing or monitoring as a program element. True if lab monitoring is required; false if not required.,
