pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,non_compliance_reason,non_compliance_reason,Non-Compliance Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text description of the reason for non-compliance with REMS program elements, if applicable. Documents barriers, patient refusal, system issues, or other factors preventing full compliance.",
