pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,patient_assistance_program_status,patient_assistance_program_status,Patient Assistance Program Status,STRING,,,,Eligible|Not Eligible|Enrolled|Pending|Expired|Not Applicable,transactional_data,"Status of patient eligibility and enrollment in manufacturer patient assistance programs for medication cost support: eligible (qualifies for assistance), not eligible (does not qualify), enrolled (actively receiving assistance), pending (application in progress), expired (assistance period ended), or not applicable (no assistance program available).",
pharmacy,safety_compliance,rems_compliance,patient_enrollment_date,patient_enrollment_date,Patient Enrollment Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date the patient completed enrollment in the REMS program. Null if enrollment is not required or not yet completed.,
