reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,hospice_indicator,hospice_indicator,Hospice Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,"For discharge disposition codes, indicates whether the disposition represents a hospice discharge (home hospice or hospice facility).",
reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,last_updated_date,last_updated_date,Last Updated Date,DATE,,,,,reference_data,The date when this code record was last modified in the reference system. Used for change tracking and data synchronization. Format: yyyy-MM-dd.,
reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,medicaid_approved_flag,medicaid_approved_flag,Medicaid Approved Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,Indicates whether this code is recognized and accepted by Medicaid programs for claims processing and reimbursement.,
reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,medicare_approved_flag,medicare_approved_flag,Medicare Approved Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,Indicates whether this code is recognized and accepted by Medicare for claims processing and reimbursement.,
