reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,professional_indicator,professional_indicator,Professional Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,Flag indicating whether this code is applicable to professional (physician) claims submitted on CMS-1500 forms.,
reference,clinical_terminology,condition_code,replacement_code,replacement_code,Replacement Code,STRING,,,,,reference_data,"For deprecated or inactive codes, the new code value that should be used instead. Null if no direct replacement exists.",
