reference,provider_registry,npi_registry,provider_gender_code,provider_gender_code,Provider Gender Code,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",M|F,master_data,"The gender of the individual provider for Type 1 NPIs. M = Male, F = Female. Used for provider demographic reporting and patient preference matching.",
