scheduling,access_coordination,booking_rule,superseded_booking_rule_id,superseded_booking_rule_id,Superseded Rule Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,scheduling.booking_rule.booking_rule_id,,,reference_data,Reference to the previous version of this rule that was replaced. Null for initial rule versions. Maintains lineage for rule versioning and audit trail.,
