scheduling,access_coordination,waitlist_entry,escalation_reason,escalation_reason,Escalation Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text or coded reason for escalation (e.g., SLA breach, high clinical priority, patient complaint, aging threshold exceeded).",
