scheduling,access_coordination,waitlist_entry,interpreter_required_flag,interpreter_required_flag,Interpreter Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether a medical interpreter is required for the appointment. True if interpreter services must be arranged.,
scheduling,access_coordination,waitlist_entry,language_preference,language_preference,Language Preference,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Patient preferred language for communication and care delivery. ISO 639-2 three-letter language code (e.g., eng for English, spa for Spanish).",
