scheduling,access_coordination,waitlist_entry,preferred_days_of_week,preferred_days_of_week,Preferred Days of Week,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Patient preference for days of the week for scheduling (e.g., Monday, Wednesday, Friday). Stored as comma-separated list or coded representation.",
