scheduling,resource_capacity,capacity_utilization,or_block_id,or_block_id,Operating Room (OR) Block ID,BIGINT,,scheduling.or_block.or_block_id,,,master_data,Reference to the OR block for which utilization is measured. Populated only when plan_type is or_block_utilization.,
