scheduling,resource_capacity,capacity_utilization,workforce_org_unit_id,workforce_org_unit_id,Department ID,BIGINT,,workforce.org_unit.org_unit_id,,,master_data,Identifier of the department or service line for which capacity is planned or measured.,
