scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,room_id,room_id,Room Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.room.room_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the specific room or treatment space allocated for this slot. Links to the room resource data product. Used for surgical scheduling (OpTime) and procedure room allocation.,
