scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,hold_reason,hold_reason,Hold Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text explanation for why the slot is held. Examples include pending insurance authorization, awaiting patient callback, reserved for urgent referral. Null if slot is not held.",
