scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,last_modified_datetime,last_modified_datetime,Last Modified Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,"The date and time when this slot record was last updated. Tracks changes to slot status, capacity, or configuration. Critical for real-time slot availability synchronization.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,max_capacity,max_capacity,Maximum Capacity,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"The maximum number of appointments that can be booked in this slot. Typically 1 for individual provider appointments, but may be higher for group visits, classes, or high-volume clinics.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,online_booking_cutoff_hours,online_booking_cutoff_hours,Online Booking Cutoff Hours,INT,,,,,transactional_data,The minimum number of hours in advance that a patient must book this slot online. Prevents same-day or last-minute online bookings. Null if no cutoff applies or online booking is disabled.,
