scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,slot_status,slot_status,Slot Status,STRING,,,,free|busy|busy-unavailable|busy-tentative|entered-in-error,transactional_data,"Current availability status of the slot. Free indicates bookable, busy indicates occupied, busy-unavailable indicates blocked, busy-tentative indicates held pending confirmation. Aligns with HL7 FHIR SlotStatus value set.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,slot_type,slot_type,Slot Type,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Classification of the slot indicating the kind of appointment or service that can be booked. Examples include new patient visit, follow-up, procedure, telehealth, walk-in. Sourced from Epic Cadence visit type or Cerner appointment type configuration.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,source_system,source_system,Source System,STRING,,,,epic_cadence|cerner_scheduling|optime|meditech|other,transactional_data,"The operational system of record from which this slot was sourced. Examples include Epic Cadence for outpatient scheduling, OpTime for surgical scheduling, Cerner scheduling for inpatient appointments.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,source_system_identifier,source_system_identifier,Source System Identifier,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"The unique identifier for this slot in the source operational system. Used for data lineage, reconciliation, and bidirectional synchronization between lakehouse and operational systems.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,specialty,specialty,Provider Specialty,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"The medical specialty or service line associated with this slot. Examples include cardiology, orthopedics, primary care, radiology. Used for specialty-specific appointment routing and capacity analysis.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,open_slot,waitlist_enabled_flag,waitlist_enabled_flag,Waitlist Enabled Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether patients can be added to a waitlist for this slot if it is fully booked. True enables waitlist management for high-demand slots. Used for cancellation backfill and access optimization.,
