scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,procedure_event_id,procedure_event_id,Procedure Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,clinical.procedure_event.procedure_event_id,,,association_data,Foreign key reference to the specific procedure or service being performed. Links to the procedure master for clinical and billing context.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,resource_employee_id,resource_employee_id,Staff Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,association_data,"Foreign key reference to the staff member (nurse, technician, assistant) assigned to support this appointment or procedure. Populated when resource_type is staff or care_team_member.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,room_id,room_id,Room Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,facility.room.room_id,,,association_data,"Foreign key reference to the physical room or space assigned for this appointment or procedure. Includes Operating Rooms (OR), exam rooms, treatment rooms, and procedure suites.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,scheduling_appointment_id,scheduling_appointment_id,Scheduling Appointment Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,scheduling.scheduling_appointment.scheduling_appointment_id,,,association_data,Foreign key reference to the appointment or scheduled event to which this resource is assigned.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,study_visit_id,study_visit_id,Study Visit Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,research.study_visit.study_visit_id,,,association_data,"Foreign key linking to research.study_visit. Business justification: Research visits require assignment of protocol-specific resources: certified research staff, specialized equipment (PET scanners, research-grade devices), and credentialed investigators. Resource assi",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,superseded_resource_assignment_id,superseded_resource_assignment_id,Substitute For Resource Assignment Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,scheduling.resource_assignment.resource_assignment_id,,,association_data,FK to the resource_assignment record that this assignment substitutes/replaces,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,surgical_case_id,surgical_case_id,Surgical Case Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,scheduling.surgical_case.surgical_case_id,,,association_data,Foreign key reference to the surgical case record when the assignment is for an Operating Room (OR) procedure. Null for non-surgical appointments.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,tertiary_employee_id,tertiary_employee_id,Requested By User Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,association_data,"Foreign key reference to the user who initially requested or created this resource assignment. Typically a scheduler, care coordinator, or provider.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,visit_id,visit_id,Visit Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,encounter.visit.visit_id,,,association_data,"Foreign key linking to encounter.visit. Business justification: Resource assignments (staff, rooms, equipment) must reconcile with actual encounter visits for billing charge capture, utilization analysis, and clinical documentation workflows. Healthcare operations",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,actual_end_datetime,actual_end_datetime,Actual End Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"Actual date and time when the resource assignment concluded. Used to calculate actual duration, resource utilization, and case completion metrics.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,actual_start_datetime,actual_start_datetime,Actual Start Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"Actual date and time when the resource assignment began. Captures real-world start time for variance analysis, billing accuracy, and operational performance measurement.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,billable_flag,billable_flag,Billable Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Boolean indicator of whether this resource assignment generates a billable charge. Used to determine which assignments flow to revenue cycle and claims processing.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,cancellation_reason,cancellation_reason,Cancellation Reason,STRING,,,,,association_data,Free-text or coded reason for cancellation of this resource assignment. Supports root cause analysis of scheduling disruptions and resource availability issues.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,cancelled_datetime,cancelled_datetime,Cancelled Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Date and time when this resource assignment was cancelled. Null if the assignment was not cancelled. Used for cancellation rate analysis and resource utilization metrics.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,charge_code,charge_code,Charge Code,STRING,,,,,association_data,Charge Description Master (CDM) code or Current Procedural Terminology (CPT) code associated with this resource assignment for billing purposes. Links assignment to revenue capture.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,confirmation_datetime,confirmation_datetime,Confirmation Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Date and time when the resource confirmed their assignment. Tracks confirmation lead time and supports compliance with staffing notification requirements.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,confirmation_status,confirmation_status,Confirmation Status,STRING,,,,pending|confirmed|declined|tentative|cancelled,association_data,Indicates whether the assigned resource has confirmed their availability and commitment to this assignment. Critical for surgical case staffing and high-acuity appointments.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,conflict_description,conflict_description,Conflict Description,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Free-text description of the nature of the scheduling conflict, if one exists. Provides context for resolution and audit trail of scheduling issues.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,conflict_flag,conflict_flag,Conflict Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Boolean indicator of whether this resource assignment has a scheduling conflict with another assignment or unavailability period. Triggers alerts for scheduling coordinators to resolve double-bookings.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,created_datetime,created_datetime,Created Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Date and time when this resource assignment record was first created in the data platform. Audit timestamp for record creation.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,credentialing_verification_datetime,credentialing_verification_datetime,Credentialing Verification Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Date and time when credentialing verification was completed for this assignment. Documents compliance with pre-assignment credentialing checks.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,credentialing_verified_flag,credentialing_verified_flag,Credentialing Verified Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,"Boolean indicator of whether the assigned resources credentials, licenses, and privileges have been verified as current and appropriate for this assignment. Critical for Joint Commission (TJC) compliance and risk management.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,duration_minutes,duration_minutes,Duration in Minutes,INT,,,,,association_data,Planned or actual duration of the resource assignment in minutes. Calculated from start and end times or specified during scheduling for capacity planning.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,equipment_asset_tag,equipment_asset_tag,Equipment Asset Tag,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Physical asset tag or serial number of the specific equipment unit assigned. Enables traceability for maintenance, sterilization, and recall management.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,equipment_reservation_status,equipment_reservation_status,Equipment Reservation Status,STRING,,,,reserved|allocated|in_use|returned|unavailable,association_data,Current status of equipment reservation for this assignment. Tracks equipment lifecycle from initial reservation through active use and return to inventory.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,last_maintenance_date,last_maintenance_date,Last Maintenance Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date of the most recent preventive or corrective maintenance performed on the assigned equipment. Supports compliance with manufacturer and regulatory maintenance schedules.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,last_modified_datetime,last_modified_datetime,Last Modified Date and Time,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,"Date and time when this resource assignment record was most recently updated. Audit timestamp for tracking changes to assignment details, status, or metadata.",
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,maintenance_clearance_flag,maintenance_clearance_flag,Maintenance Clearance Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Boolean indicator of whether assigned equipment has passed required maintenance checks and is cleared for clinical use. Ensures equipment safety and regulatory compliance.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,no_show_flag,no_show_flag,No-Show Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Boolean indicator of whether the assigned resource failed to appear for their scheduled assignment. Used for provider and staff attendance tracking and performance management.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,primary_assignment_flag,primary_assignment_flag,Primary Assignment Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Boolean indicator of whether this is the primary resource assignment for the appointment or case. Distinguishes the lead provider or primary room from supporting resources.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,privilege_code,privilege_code,Clinical Privilege Code,STRING,,,,,association_data,Code representing the specific clinical privilege or authorization required and verified for this assignment. Links to the providers credentialed privileges for the procedure or service type.,
scheduling,resource_capacity,resource_assignment,provider_assignment_notes,provider_assignment_notes,Assignment Notes,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Free-text notes or special instructions related to this resource assignment. May include preferences, constraints, special equipment needs, or coordination details.",
