supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,annual_commitment_amount,annual_commitment_amount,Annual Commitment Amount,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,dbx_confidential,,master_data,The minimum annual spend or purchase volume (in contract currency) committed by the healthcare organization to maintain contracted pricing and GPO compliance tier. Failure to meet this threshold may result in pricing tier downgrade or contract non-compliance.,
