supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,expiration_date,expiration_date,Contract Expiration Date,DATE,,,dbx_confidential,,master_data,Date on which the contract terms cease to be enforceable. Null for evergreen or open-ended agreements. Triggers renewal workflow alerts when within the renewal_notice_days threshold.,
