supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,is_diversity_spend,is_diversity_spend,Diversity Spend Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether purchases under this contract qualify for diversity spend credit reporting (Minority-Owned, Women-Owned, Veteran-Owned, or Small Business Enterprise). Supports organizational diversity procurement reporting and regulatory compliance.",
