supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,pricing_tier_structure,pricing_tier_structure,Pricing Tier Structure,STRING,,,dbx_confidential,fixed|tiered_volume|market_basket|cost_plus|fee_schedule|index_linked,master_data,Describes the pricing model applied under this contract. Fixed pricing applies a single unit price; tiered volume pricing adjusts price based on purchase volume thresholds; market basket pricing ties to a defined product mix; cost-plus adds a margin to vendor cost; fee schedule uses a published rate table; index-linked ties to a commodity or inflation index.,
supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,product_category,product_category,Product Category,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Primary supply category covered by this contract (e.g., Medical-Surgical Consumables, Implantable Devices, Pharmaceuticals, Capital Equipment, Laboratory Reagents, Sterile Processing Supplies). Aligns with the organizations supply chain taxonomy and GPO category codes.",
