supply,vendor_procurement,vendor_contract,rebate_terms,rebate_terms,Rebate Terms,STRING,,,dbx_confidential,,master_data,"Narrative description of rebate eligibility conditions, payment schedule, and calculation methodology (e.g., Quarterly rebate paid within 45 days of quarter-end upon achieving $500K spend threshold). Supplements the numeric rebate_pct field.",
