claim,adjudication_resolution,claim_appeal,coordination_of_benefits_issue_flag,coordination_of_benefits_issue_flag,Coordination of Benefits (COB) Issue Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicates whether the denial and appeal involve coordination of benefits disputes between multiple payers. True when primary/secondary payer responsibility is contested.,
