claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,payer_claim_control_number,payer_claim_control_number,Payer Claim Control Number,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,The payer-assigned unique identifier for the claim as reported in the ERA. Used for cross-referencing with payer systems and correspondence.,
claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,posting_date,posting_date,Posting Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date on which the remittance line was posted to the patient account or billing system. Used for cash application tracking and accounts receivable aging.,
claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,procedure_code,procedure_code,Procedure Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,The Current Procedural Terminology (CPT) or Healthcare Common Procedure Coding System (HCPCS) code for the service rendered. Identifies the specific medical procedure or service being paid.,
claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,procedure_modifier_1,procedure_modifier_1,Procedure Modifier 1,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,First modifier code appended to the procedure code to provide additional information about the service performed. Affects reimbursement and adjudication logic.,
