claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,remittance_advice_remark_code,remittance_advice_remark_code,Remittance Advice Remark Code (RARC),STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Supplemental code providing additional information or instructions related to the claim adjudication. Used in conjunction with CARC to provide complete explanation of payment decisions.,
claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,revenue_code,revenue_code,Revenue Code,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Four-digit code used on institutional claims (UB-04) to identify the specific accommodation, ancillary service, or billing calculation related to the service. Used primarily for hospital billing.",
