claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,updated_timestamp,updated_timestamp,Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,The date and time when this remittance line record was last modified. Tracks changes for audit purposes and data quality monitoring.,
claim,adjudication_resolution,remittance_line,variance_amount,variance_amount,Variance Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,The difference between expected payment (based on contract terms) and actual payment received. Used for contract compliance monitoring and underpayment identification.,
