insurance,member_operations,accumulator,payer_id,payer_id,Payer Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,insurance.payer.payer_id,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for the insurance payer organization responsible for the health plan and benefit adjudication.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,prior_accumulator_id,prior_accumulator_id,Prior Accumulator Id,BIGINT,,insurance.accumulator.accumulator_id,dbx_self_ref_fk,,transactional_data,Self-referencing FK on accumulator (prior_accumulator_id),
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,subscriber_id,subscriber_id,Subscriber Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,insurance.subscriber.subscriber_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,transactional_data,Unique identifier for the primary subscriber of the health plan. May differ from member_id for dependents.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,accumulated_amount,accumulated_amount,Accumulated Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,The year-to-date dollar amount or count that has been accumulated toward the benefit threshold. Represents member cost-sharing contributions or service utilization.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,accumulator_status,accumulator_status,Accumulator Status,STRING,,,,active|suspended|closed|pending_reset,transactional_data,"Current operational status of the accumulator: active (accumulating), suspended (temporarily paused), closed (benefit period ended), or pending reset (awaiting new benefit year initialization).",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,accumulator_type,accumulator_type,Accumulator Type,STRING,,,,individual_deductible|family_deductible|individual_oop_max|family_oop_max|visit_limit|service_limit,transactional_data,"The category of benefit accumulation being tracked: individual deductible, family deductible, individual out-of-pocket (OOP) maximum, family OOP maximum, visit limit, or service-specific dollar limit.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,adjustment_amount,adjustment_amount,Adjustment Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"Total dollar amount of manual adjustments applied to this accumulator due to claim reversals, appeals, or administrative corrections. May be positive or negative.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,adjustment_count,adjustment_count,Adjustment Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,The number of adjustment transactions applied to this accumulator. Used for audit trail and data quality monitoring.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,benefit_period_end_date,benefit_period_end_date,Benefit Period End Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date when the benefit accumulation period ends. Typically December 31 or the plan termination date.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,benefit_period_start_date,benefit_period_start_date,Benefit Period Start Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date when the benefit accumulation period begins. Typically January 1 or the plan effective date for mid-year enrollments.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,benefit_year,benefit_year,Benefit Year,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Calendar year for which the accumulator is tracking benefit utilization. Accumulators typically reset annually on the plan renewal date.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,carryover_amount,carryover_amount,Carryover Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"Dollar amount carried over from the previous benefit period, if the plan allows deductible or OOP carryover for services rendered near year-end.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,carryover_indicator,carryover_indicator,Carryover Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether this accumulator includes carryover amounts from a prior benefit period. True if carryover_amount is greater than zero.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,coverage_level,coverage_level,Coverage Level,STRING,,,,individual|family|employee_spouse|employee_children|employee_family,transactional_data,"The tier of coverage for which the accumulator applies: individual, family, employee plus spouse, employee plus children, or full family.",
