insurance,member_operations,accumulator,cross_accumulation_indicator,cross_accumulation_indicator,Cross Accumulation Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether amounts in this accumulator also count toward other accumulator types. For example, deductible amounts may also count toward OOP max.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,currency_code,currency_code,Currency Code,STRING,,,,USD,transactional_data,Three-letter ISO 4217 currency code for all monetary amounts in this accumulator. Typically USD for US-based healthcare plans.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,embedded_deductible_indicator,embedded_deductible_indicator,Embedded Deductible Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether this family-level accumulator uses embedded individual deductibles. True means each family member has an individual deductible within the family deductible.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,facility_service_category,facility_service_category,Service Category,STRING,,,,medical|pharmacy|dental|vision|behavioral_health|all_services,transactional_data,"The category of healthcare services to which this accumulator applies: medical, pharmacy, dental, vision, behavioral health, or all services combined.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,last_adjustment_date,last_adjustment_date,Last Adjustment Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date of the most recent adjustment transaction applied to this accumulator. Null if no adjustments have been made.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,last_claim_date,last_claim_date,Last Claim Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Service date of the most recent claim that updated this accumulator. Used for recency tracking and accumulator aging analysis.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,last_updated_timestamp,last_updated_timestamp,Last Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,The date and time when this accumulator record was last modified. Critical for real-time benefit calculation and member portal display.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,network_type,network_type,Network Type,STRING,,,,in_network|out_of_network|both,transactional_data,"Indicates whether the accumulator tracks in-network services, out-of-network services, or a combined bucket for both network types.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,notes,notes,Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text field for additional context, special circumstances, or administrative notes related to this accumulator. May include explanations for manual adjustments or unusual accumulation patterns.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,plan_year_sequence,plan_year_sequence,Plan Year Sequence,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Sequential counter indicating which plan year this accumulator represents for the member. Value of 1 for first year, 2 for second year, etc. Used for multi-year trend analysis.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,remaining_amount,remaining_amount,Remaining Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,The remaining balance before the threshold is met. Calculated as threshold_amount minus accumulated_amount. Critical for member cost-sharing estimates.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,reset_date,reset_date,Reset Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,"The date when this accumulator was last reset to zero, typically at the start of a new benefit period or upon plan change.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,source_system,source_system,Source System,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"The name or identifier of the operational system that originated this accumulator record. Examples: Epic Resolute, Cerner Revenue Cycle, or proprietary claims adjudication platform.",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,threshold_amount,threshold_amount,Threshold Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,,,transactional_data,"The plan-defined maximum amount or limit for this accumulator type. Once reached, benefit rules change (e.g., deductible met, OOP max reached).",
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,threshold_met_date,threshold_met_date,Threshold Met Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date on which the member first met the benefit threshold. Null if threshold has not been met. Used for benefit transition tracking and member communication.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,threshold_met_indicator,threshold_met_indicator,Threshold Met Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether the member has met or exceeded the benefit threshold for this accumulator type. True when accumulated_amount >= threshold_amount.,
insurance,member_operations,accumulator,transaction_count,transaction_count,Transaction Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,The total number of claim transactions that have contributed to this accumulator balance. Used for utilization pattern analysis.,
insurance,member_operations,coordination_of_benefits,coordination_of_benefits_id,coordination_of_benefits_id,Coordination of Benefits (COB) ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the coordination of benefits record. Primary key.,
