insurance,member_operations,coordination_of_benefits,primary_coordination_health_plan_id,primary_coordination_health_plan_id,Primary Health Plan ID,BIGINT,,insurance.health_plan.health_plan_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii",,master_data,Unique identifier for the health plan designated as primary coverage.,
