insurance,member_operations,coordination_of_benefits,subscriber_id,subscriber_id,Subscriber ID,BIGINT,,insurance.subscriber.subscriber_id,"dbx_restricted, dbx_pii_identifier",,master_data,Unique identifier for the primary subscriber on the insurance policy.,
