insurance,payer_administration,payer,edi_payer_code,edi_payer_code,Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) Payer Identifier,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Payer identifier used in EDI transactions, typically the ISA06 qualifier value in X12 837 claim submissions and 835 remittance advice. May differ from NPI or external payer ID.",
