insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_address_line1,remittance_address_line1,Remittance Address Line 1,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",,master_data,First line of the payers remittance mailing address where paper checks and EOBs are sent. Includes street number and street name.,
insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_address_line2,remittance_address_line2,Remittance Address Line 2,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",,master_data,"Second line of the payers remittance mailing address. Typically contains suite, floor, department, or other secondary address information. Null if not applicable.",
insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_city,remittance_city,Remittance City,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",,master_data,City name for the payers remittance mailing address.,
insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_delivery_method,remittance_delivery_method,Remittance Delivery Method,STRING,,,,edi_835|era|paper_eob|portal,master_data,Method by which the payer delivers remittance advice. EDI 835 indicates electronic remittance advice via X12 835 transaction; ERA (Electronic Remittance Advice) is synonym for EDI 835; paper EOB (Explanation of Benefits) indicates physical mail; portal indicates download from payer website.,
insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_postal_code,remittance_postal_code,Remittance Postal Code,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",^[0-9]{5}(-[0-9]{4})?$,master_data,ZIP code or ZIP+4 code for the payers remittance mailing address. Format: XXXXX or XXXXX-XXXX.,
insurance,payer_administration,payer,remittance_state,remittance_state,Remittance State,STRING,,,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii_address",^[A-Z]{2}$,master_data,Two-letter state or territory abbreviation for the payers remittance mailing address. Follows USPS state abbreviation standards.,
