insurance,plan_management,benefit,formulary_tier,formulary_tier,Formulary Tier,STRING,,,,tier_1|tier_2|tier_3|tier_4|specialty,master_data,"Pharmacy formulary tier for drug benefits indicating cost-sharing level. Tier 1 typically generic, Tier 2 preferred brand, Tier 3 non-preferred brand, Tier 4 specialty drugs.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,hsa_eligible_flag,hsa_eligible_flag,Health Savings Account (HSA) Eligible Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether this benefit is compatible with Health Savings Account (HSA) requirements. True if benefit meets HSA-qualified high-deductible health plan (HDHP) rules.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,limitations_text,limitations_text,Benefit Limitations Text,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Narrative description of limitations, restrictions, or conditions that apply to this benefit beyond the structured limit fields.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,mail_order_available_flag,mail_order_available_flag,Mail Order Available Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether this pharmacy benefit can be fulfilled through mail order pharmacy with potentially different cost-sharing. True if mail order option available.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Benefit Record Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when this benefit record was last modified. Updated whenever any attribute changes. Used for change tracking and audit compliance.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,network_type,network_type,Network Type,STRING,,,,in_network|out_of_network|both,master_data,"Indicates whether this benefit applies to in-network providers, out-of-network providers, or both. Critical for cost-sharing calculation and provider network adjudication.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,out_of_pocket_applies_flag,out_of_pocket_applies_flag,Out-of-Pocket (OOP) Maximum Applies Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether member cost-sharing for this benefit counts toward the annual out-of-pocket maximum. True if it counts, False if excluded (e.g., non-covered services).",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,place_of_service_code,place_of_service_code,Place of Service (POS) Code,STRING,,,,^[0-9]{2}$,master_data,"Standard two-digit code identifying where the service is delivered (e.g., 11=Office, 21=Inpatient Hospital, 22=Outpatient Hospital, 23=Emergency Room). Used for benefit adjudication rules.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,preventive_care_flag,preventive_care_flag,Preventive Care Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether this benefit is classified as preventive care under ACA requirements. Preventive services must be covered at 100% with no cost-sharing when delivered in-network.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,prior_authorization_required_flag,prior_authorization_required_flag,Prior Authorization (PA) Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether prior authorization from the health plan is required before the service is covered. True if PA required, False otherwise.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,procedure_code_type,procedure_code_type,Procedure Code Type,STRING,,,,CPT|HCPCS|ICD10PCS|CDT|revenue_code,master_data,"Type of procedure coding system used to identify services covered by this benefit. CPT for physician services, HCPCS for supplies and equipment, ICD-10-PCS for inpatient procedures, CDT for dental.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,quantity_limit_flag,quantity_limit_flag,Quantity Limit Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether this benefit has quantity or frequency limits (e.g., maximum number of visits, days supply, units per fill). True if limits apply.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,referral_required_flag,referral_required_flag,Referral Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether a referral from Primary Care Physician (PCP) is required to access this benefit. Common in Health Maintenance Organization (HMO) plans.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,step_therapy_required_flag,step_therapy_required_flag,Step Therapy Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether step therapy protocol must be followed (trying lower-cost alternatives before higher-cost treatments). Primarily used for pharmacy benefits.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,subcategory,subcategory,Benefit Subcategory,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Detailed subcategory within the benefit category providing granular service classification. Example: Acute Inpatient, Observation Stay, Ambulatory Surgery.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,termination_date,termination_date,Benefit Termination Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when this benefit component is no longer active. Null for currently active benefits with no planned end date.,
insurance,plan_management,benefit,tier,tier,Benefit Tier,STRING,,,,tier_1|tier_2|tier_3|tier_4|specialty,master_data,"Tiering level of the benefit indicating cost-sharing structure. Commonly used for pharmacy benefits (generic, preferred brand, non-preferred brand, specialty) and provider networks (in-network tier 1, tier 2).",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,visit_limit_count,visit_limit_count,Visit Limit Count,INT,,,,,master_data,"Maximum number of visits or services allowed per benefit period (e.g., 20 physical therapy visits per year). Null if no visit limit applies.",
insurance,plan_management,benefit,visit_limit_period,visit_limit_period,Visit Limit Period,STRING,,,,per_day|per_week|per_month|per_year|per_lifetime,master_data,"Time period over which the visit limit count applies. Example: per_year for annual limits, per_lifetime for lifetime maximums.",
insurance,plan_management,health_plan,health_plan_id,health_plan_id,Health Plan ID,BIGINT,Y,," dbx_restricted, dbx_pii",,master_data,Unique identifier for the health plan product. Primary key for the health plan entity.,
