insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_end_date,attribution_end_date,Attribution End Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,"Date when the member attribution assignment ends. Null for open-ended attributions. May be populated due to member disenrollment, provider termination, or contract end.",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_lock_date,attribution_lock_date,Attribution Lock Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date when the attribution assignment was locked for the performance year and can no longer be changed. Used to ensure stable attribution for performance measurement.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_method,attribution_method,Attribution Method,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Method used to assign the member to the attributed provider. Prospective attribution occurs before the performance period; retrospective attribution occurs after using claims data; voluntary attribution is patient-selected; claims-based uses utilization patterns; enrollment-based uses plan enrollment data; patient-designated is explicit patient choice; hybrid combines multiple methods. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: prospective|retrospective|voluntary|claims_based|enrollment_based|patient_designated|hybrid — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_period_end_date,attribution_period_end_date,Attribution Period End Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,End date of the measurement period used to calculate the attribution assignment. Typically the end of the performance year or lookback period.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_period_start_date,attribution_period_start_date,Attribution Period Start Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Start date of the measurement period used to calculate the attribution assignment. Typically the beginning of the performance year or lookback period.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_source,attribution_source,Attribution Source,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Source system or method that generated the attribution assignment. Claims-based uses historical utilization; enrollment-based uses plan enrollment data; patient-designated is explicit patient selection; provider-roster uses provider panel lists; ACO-assignment is CMS ACO attribution; manual-override is administrative assignment; system-calculated is algorithmic. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: claims_based|enrollment_based|patient_designated|provider_roster|aco_assignment|manual_override|system_calculated — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_status,attribution_status,Attribution Status,STRING,,,,active|inactive|pending|terminated|suspended,transactional_data,Current lifecycle status of the attribution assignment. Active indicates the attribution is currently in effect; inactive indicates it is no longer valid; pending indicates it is awaiting approval or effective date; terminated indicates it was ended; suspended indicates temporary hold.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,attribution_type,attribution_type,Attribution Type,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Type of value-based care or managed care program under which the attribution is made. ACO is Accountable Care Organization; MSSP is Medicare Shared Savings Program; NextGen ACO is Next Generation ACO Model; managed care is HMO/PPO attribution; capitation is capitated payment model; VBC is value-based care contract; PCMH is Patient-Centered Medical Home; bundled payment is episode-based attribution. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: aco|mssp|nextgen_aco|managed_care|capitation|vbc|pcmh|bundled_payment — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,bigint_surrogate_key_for_clean_keying,bigint_surrogate_key_for_clean_keying,Mpi Record Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to patient.mpi_record. Business justification: Value-based care attribution assigns patients to providers for ACO/MSSP quality and cost accountability. Business process: attribution rosters for shared savings programs require patient identity link,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,capitation_amount,capitation_amount,Capitation Amount,"DECIMAL(12,2)",,,dbx_confidential,,transactional_data,Per-member per-month (PMPM) or per-member per-year (PMPY) capitation payment amount for this attributed member under the contract. Null if the contract is not capitated.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,capitation_frequency,capitation_frequency,Capitation Frequency,STRING,,,,monthly|quarterly|annually,transactional_data,Frequency at which capitation payments are made for this attributed member. Monthly is per-member per-month; quarterly is per-member per-quarter; annually is per-member per-year.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,county_code,county_code,County Code,STRING,,,,^[0-9]{5}$,transactional_data,Five-digit FIPS county code where the member resides. Used for county-level performance reporting and geographic analysis.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Timestamp when this attribution record was first created in the system. Used for audit trail and data lineage.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,geographic_service_area,geographic_service_area,Geographic Service Area,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Geographic region or service area code where the member resides and receives care. Used for network adequacy and regional performance reporting.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,notes,notes,Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text notes or comments about this attribution assignment. Used for documenting special circumstances, manual overrides, or additional context.",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,opt_out_date,opt_out_date,Opt-Out Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date when the member opted out of attribution or data sharing. Null if opt-out indicator is false.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,opt_out_indicator,opt_out_indicator,Opt-Out Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether the member has opted out of attribution or data sharing for performance measurement. True indicates opt-out; false indicates consent.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,performance_year,performance_year,Performance Year,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Calendar year for which this attribution is used for performance measurement and shared savings calculation. Four-digit year (e.g., 2023).",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,plurality_of_care_indicator,plurality_of_care_indicator,Plurality of Care Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean flag indicating whether the attributed provider delivered a plurality (most) of the members primary care services during the measurement period. True indicates plurality was met; false indicates it was not.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,primary_care_visit_count,primary_care_visit_count,Primary Care Visit Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of primary care visits the member had with the attributed provider during the attribution measurement period. Used to calculate plurality and attribution strength.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,provider_assignment_reason,provider_assignment_reason,Assignment Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text or coded reason explaining why the member was attributed to this provider. Examples include highest visit count, patient selection, geographic proximity, or continuity of care.",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,quality_measure_set,quality_measure_set,Quality Measure Set,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name or identifier of the quality measure set applicable to this attribution for performance measurement. Examples include MSSP quality measures, HEDIS measures, or custom contract measures.",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,risk_score,risk_score,Risk Score,"DECIMAL(6,3)",,,,,transactional_data,Hierarchical Condition Category (HCC) risk score or other risk adjustment score for the member at the time of attribution. Used for risk-adjusted performance measurement and capitation payment calculation.,
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,shared_savings_eligible,shared_savings_eligible,Shared Savings Eligible,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Boolean flag indicating whether this attributed member is eligible for inclusion in shared savings calculations. True indicates eligible; false indicates excluded (e.g., due to insufficient claims history or enrollment duration).",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,source_system,source_system,Source System,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name or identifier of the source system that generated or provided this attribution record. Examples include Epic Healthy Planet, claims processing system, or attribution calculation engine.",
insurance,value_reimbursement,member_attribution,state_code,state_code,State Code,STRING,,,,^[A-Z]{2}$,transactional_data,Two-letter US state code where the member resides. Used for state-level reporting and regulatory compliance.,
