provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,provider_location_id,provider_location_id,Provider Location ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique surrogate identifier for each provider practice location record in the master provider location registry. Primary key for this entity.,
provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,clinician_id,clinician_id,Provider ID,BIGINT,,provider.clinician.clinician_id,,,master_data,Reference to the individual clinician or organizational provider associated with this practice location. Links to the provider master record.,
