provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,directory_last_verified_date,directory_last_verified_date,Provider Directory Last Verified Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the provider location information was last verified for accuracy in the provider directory. Supports CMS and NCQA provider directory accuracy requirements and audit trails.,
