provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,hours_of_operation,hours_of_operation,Hours of Operation,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Structured or free-text representation of the practice locations regular operating hours by day of week (e.g., Mon-Fri 08:00-17:00, Sat 09:00-13:00). Used in provider directories and patient access reporting.",
provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,is_accepting_new_patients,is_accepting_new_patients,Accepting New Patients Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the provider at this location is currently accepting new patients. Critical field for provider directory accuracy, CMS network adequacy compliance, and patient access reporting. CMS requires this to be updated at least every 90 days.",
