provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,network_participation_status,network_participation_status,Network Participation Status,STRING,,,,in_network|out_of_network|pending|terminated,master_data,"Current payer network participation status for this location. Indicates whether the location is contracted as in-network, out-of-network, pending credentialing, or terminated. Drives claims adjudication and patient cost-sharing calculations.",
provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,npi,npi,National Provider Identifier (NPI),STRING,,,,^[0-9]{10}$,master_data,"The 10-digit National Provider Identifier assigned by CMS to the provider or organization at this location. Used for claims submission, payer enrollment, and provider directory publishing. May be the individual NPI (Type 1) or organizational NPI (Type 2) depending on the location context.",
