provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,public_transit_access,public_transit_access,Public Transit Access Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether the practice location is accessible via public transportation. Supports Social Determinants of Health (SDOH) analysis and patient access equity reporting.,
provider,workforce_identity,provider_location,source_system,source_system,Source System,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Name of the operational system of record from which this provider location record was sourced (e.g., Epic Cadence, Symplr, NPPES). Supports data lineage, ETL audit, and master data management reconciliation. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: Epic|Cerner|MEDITECH|Symplr|NPPES|CMS|Salesforce|Manual — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
