compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,enforcement_mechanism,enforcement_mechanism,Enforcement Mechanism,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of how compliance with the policy is monitored and enforced (e.g., Audit, Peer Review, Automated System Controls, Disciplinary Action).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,expiration_date,expiration_date,Policy Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the policy ceases to be in effect. Nullable for policies without a predetermined end date.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,keywords,keywords,Policy Keywords,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Comma-separated list of keywords or tags to facilitate search and discovery of the policy in the policy library (e.g., HIPAA, PHI, Privacy, Security, Breach Notification).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,last_review_date,last_review_date,Last Review Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the policy was most recently reviewed and validated for accuracy and compliance.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Record Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when the policy record was last updated in the system. Follows format yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.SSSXXX.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,next_review_date,next_review_date,Next Scheduled Review Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Scheduled date for the next mandatory review of the policy. Calculated based on effective date and review cycle.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,non_compliance_consequence,non_compliance_consequence,Non-Compliance Consequence,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of the consequences for failure to comply with the policy (e.g., Verbal Warning, Written Reprimand, Suspension, Termination, Regulatory Sanction).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,owner_department,owner_department,Policy Owner Department,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Department or organizational unit responsible for maintaining, updating, and enforcing the policy (e.g., Health Information Management (HIM), Compliance, Clinical Quality, Human Resources).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,owner_role,owner_role,Policy Owner Role,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Job title or role of the individual accountable for the policy (e.g., Chief Compliance Officer, Chief Nursing Officer (CNO), Director of Health Information Management (HIM), Chief Privacy Officer).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,policy_category,policy_category,Policy Category,STRING,,,,,master_data,Primary classification of the policy indicating the functional area it governs. Clinical policies govern patient care delivery; administrative policies govern operational processes; HR policies govern workforce management; privacy/security policies govern Protected Health Information (PHI) and data security; safety policies govern workplace and patient safety; billing/revenue policies govern Revenue Cycle Management (RCM) and financial operations; compliance/regulatory policies govern adherence to external mandates. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: clinical|administrative|human_resources|privacy_security|safety|billing_revenue|compliance_regulatory — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,policy_number,policy_number,Policy Number,STRING,,,,"^POL-[A-Z]{2,4}-d{4,6}$",master_data,Human-readable unique policy identifier used for reference and citation across the organization. Typically follows format POL-[CATEGORY]-[SEQUENCE].,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,policy_status,policy_status,Policy Status,STRING,,,,,master_data,Current lifecycle state of the policy. Draft indicates initial authoring; under review indicates pending approval; approved indicates authorized but not yet effective; active indicates currently in force; suspended indicates temporarily inactive; retired indicates no longer in use; superseded indicates replaced by a newer version. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: draft|under_review|approved|active|suspended|retired|superseded — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,public_facing_flag,public_facing_flag,Public Facing Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether the policy is intended for public disclosure (e.g., patient rights policies, privacy notices). True if the policy is public-facing; False if internal only.",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,purpose,purpose,Policy Purpose,STRING,,,,,master_data,Detailed statement of the business or regulatory objective the policy is designed to achieve.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,regulatory_requirement_satisfied,regulatory_requirement_satisfied,Regulatory Requirement Satisfied,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Comma-separated list of regulatory requirements, standards, or mandates that this policy addresses (e.g., HIPAA Privacy Rule 45 CFR 164.530, Joint Commission (TJC) Standard LD.04.03.11, Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS) Conditions of Participation 42 CFR 482.13, Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) Bloodborne Pathogens Standard 29 CFR 1910.1030).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,related_procedure_references,related_procedure_references,Related Procedure References,STRING,,,,,master_data,Comma-separated list of procedure document numbers or identifiers that provide step-by-step implementation guidance for this policy. Procedures are distinct from policies (policies define what must be done; procedures define how to do it).,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,related_standard_references,related_standard_references,Related Standard References,STRING,,,,,master_data,Comma-separated list of organizational standards or technical specifications that support or complement this policy.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,retired_reason,retired_reason,Policy Retired Reason,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Explanation for why the policy was retired (e.g., Superseded by POL-COMP-002456, Regulatory Requirement No Longer Applicable, Organizational Restructuring).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,retired_timestamp,retired_timestamp,Policy Retired Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Timestamp when the policy was formally retired or superseded. Nullable if the policy is still active. Follows format yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.SSSXXX.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,review_cycle_months,review_cycle_months,Review Cycle (Months),INT,,,,,master_data,"Frequency in months at which the policy must be reviewed for continued relevance, accuracy, and regulatory alignment. Common values are 12, 24, or 36 months.",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,scope_of_application,scope_of_application,Scope of Application,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of the organizational units, roles, or locations to which the policy applies (e.g., All Clinical Staff, All Facilities, Emergency Department (ED) Only, Revenue Cycle Management (RCM) Department).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,subcategory,subcategory,Policy Subcategory,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Secondary classification providing additional granularity within the policy category (e.g., Infection Control under Clinical, HIPAA Compliance under Privacy/Security, Credentialing under Administrative).",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,summary,summary,Policy Summary,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Brief executive summary of the policy purpose, key requirements, and intended outcomes. Typically 2-3 sentences.",
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,supersedes_policy_number,supersedes_policy_number,Supersedes Policy Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,Policy number of the previous version or policy that this policy replaces. Nullable if this is the first version.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,title,title,Policy Title,STRING,,,,,master_data,Official title of the policy as it appears in the policy library and governance documentation.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,training_frequency_months,training_frequency_months,Training Frequency (Months),INT,,,,,master_data,Frequency in months at which staff must complete refresher training on this policy. Nullable if training is one-time or not required.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,training_required_flag,training_required_flag,Training Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,Indicates whether staff are required to complete formal training on this policy. True if training is mandatory; False if training is optional or not required.,
compliance,policy_management,compliance_policy,version_number,version_number,Policy Version Number,STRING,,,,^d+.d+$,master_data,"Version identifier for the policy document, typically in major.minor format (e.g., 1.0, 2.1). Incremented with each revision.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,policy_payer_applicability_id,policy_payer_applicability_id,Policy-Payer Applicability ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,association_data,Unique identifier for this policy-payer applicability record. Primary key.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,compliance_policy_id,compliance_policy_id,Policy Payer Applicability - Policy Id,BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_policy.compliance_policy_id,,,association_data,Foreign key linking to the organizational policy that applies to this payer relationship.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,payer_id,payer_id,Policy Payer Applicability - Payer Id,BIGINT,,insurance.payer.payer_id,,,association_data,Foreign key linking to the insurance payer to whom this policy applies.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,attestation_required,attestation_required,Attestation Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether the payer is required to formally attest to compliance with this policy as part of the contractual relationship. True for policies with regulatory or contractual attestation requirements.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,compliance_status,compliance_status,Compliance Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current compliance status of the payer with respect to this policy. Compliant indicates the payer meets all policy requirements; non_compliant indicates violations or gaps; pending_review indicates assessment in progress; waived indicates formal exception granted; not_applicable indicates policy does not apply to this payer relationship.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,distribution_date,distribution_date,Policy Distribution Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this policy was distributed or communicated to the payer. Tracks when the payer was notified of policy requirements.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,effective_date,effective_date,Applicability Effective Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this policy became applicable to this payer relationship. May differ from the policys overall effective date if the payer contract was established after policy adoption.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,last_compliance_review_date,last_compliance_review_date,Last Compliance Review Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which compliance with this policy was most recently assessed for this payer relationship. Used for audit tracking and review cycle management.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,next_compliance_review_date,next_compliance_review_date,Next Compliance Review Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Scheduled date for the next compliance review of this payer against this policy. Calculated based on policy review cycle and payer contract terms.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,notes,notes,Applicability Notes,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Free-text notes documenting payer-specific considerations, exceptions, or implementation details for this policy applicability. Used for operational context and audit trail.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,payer_acknowledgment_date,payer_acknowledgment_date,Payer Acknowledgment Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which the payer formally acknowledged receipt and acceptance of this policy as part of the contractual relationship. Required for contract compliance and audit trail.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,payer_specific_version,payer_specific_version,Payer-Specific Policy Version,STRING,,,,,association_data,Version identifier for the payer-specific adaptation or addendum to the base policy. Some payers require customized policy language or additional requirements beyond the base organizational policy.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,termination_date,termination_date,Applicability Termination Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this policy ceased to apply to this payer relationship. Nullable for ongoing applicability. Used when payer contracts end or policies are superseded.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,waiver_approval_authority,waiver_approval_authority,Waiver Approval Authority,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Individual, role, or committee that approved the waiver for this payer-policy combination. Nullable if no waiver granted.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,waiver_granted_flag,waiver_granted_flag,Waiver Granted Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether a formal waiver or exception has been granted exempting this payer from this policy requirement. True indicates waiver in effect.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_payer_applicability,waiver_justification,waiver_justification,Waiver Justification,STRING,,,,,association_data,Business or regulatory justification for granting a waiver exempting this payer from this policy. Nullable if no waiver granted. Required for audit and governance documentation.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,policy_regulatory_impact_id,policy_regulatory_impact_id,Policy Regulatory Impact ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,association_data,Unique identifier for this policy regulatory impact record. Primary key.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,compliance_policy_id,compliance_policy_id,Policy Regulatory Impact - Policy Id,BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_policy.compliance_policy_id,,,association_data,"Foreign key linking to the organizational policy that was created, updated, or retired in response to the regulatory change.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,employee_id,employee_id,Compliance Officer ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"confidential,pii",,association_data,Reference to the compliance officer responsible for managing this specific policy response to this regulatory change. May differ from the overall regulatory change owner if different officers manage different policy impacts.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,regulatory_change_id,regulatory_change_id,Policy Regulatory Impact - Regulatory Change Id,BIGINT,,compliance.regulatory_change.regulatory_change_id,,,association_data,Foreign key linking to the regulatory change that triggered the policy action.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,change_summary,change_summary,Policy Change Summary,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Summary of the specific changes made to this policy in response to this regulatory change. Describes what was added, modified, or removed from the policy to achieve compliance.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Timestamp when this policy regulatory impact record was created in the system.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,effective_date,effective_date,Policy Response Effective Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,The date when the policy change or new policy becomes effective in response to the regulatory change. This is the date when the policy update driven by this regulatory change takes effect.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,impact_assessment_date,impact_assessment_date,Impact Assessment Completion Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,The date when the impact assessment for this regulatory change on this specific policy was completed.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,impact_assessment_status,impact_assessment_status,Impact Assessment Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current status of the impact assessment for this specific regulatory change on this specific policy. Tracks the workflow state of evaluating how the regulatory change affects this policy.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,implementation_date,implementation_date,Implementation Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,The date when the policy changes required by this regulatory change were fully implemented and operationalized across the organization.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,policy_version_created,policy_version_created,Policy Version Created,STRING,,,,,association_data,The version number of the policy that was created or updated as a result of this regulatory change. Links the regulatory change to the specific policy version it triggered.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,response_type,response_type,Policy Response Type,STRING,,,,,association_data,"The type of policy action taken in response to this regulatory change. Indicates whether a new policy was created, an existing policy was updated, a policy was retired, or no policy action was required.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_regulatory_impact,updated_timestamp,updated_timestamp,Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Timestamp when this policy regulatory impact record was last updated.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,policy_version_id,policy_version_id,Policy Version Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,transactional_data,Unique identifier for each policy version record. Primary key for the policy version history table.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,compliance_policy_id,compliance_policy_id,Policy Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_policy.compliance_policy_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the parent policy master record. Links this version to the overarching policy entity.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,policy_employee_id,policy_employee_id,Policy Version Approver Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential,dbx_pii,pii_phi,pii_pii,pii_sensitive",,transactional_data,Reference to the executive or governance body that formally approved this policy version. Critical for demonstrating authorized policy adoption.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,primary_employee_id,primary_employee_id,Policy Version Author Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential,dbx_pii,pii_phi,pii_pii,pii_sensitive",,transactional_data,Reference to the employee or role responsible for drafting this policy version. Required for accountability and audit trail per Joint Commission standards.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,primary_superseded_version_policy_version_id,primary_superseded_version_policy_version_id,Superseded Policy Version Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,compliance.policy_version.policy_version_id,,,transactional_data,Reference to the prior policy version that this version replaces. Null for the initial version. Enables version lineage tracking and audit trail reconstruction.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,reviewer_employee_id,reviewer_employee_id,Policy Version Reviewer Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential,dbx_pii,pii_phi,pii_pii,pii_sensitive",,transactional_data,Reference to the employee or committee responsible for reviewing this policy version prior to approval. Part of the governance workflow audit trail.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,approval_date,approval_date,Policy Version Approval Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which this policy version received formal approval. Required for Joint Commission and CMS audit trail compliance.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,attestation_required_flag,attestation_required_flag,Attestation Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether staff must formally attest to having read and understood this policy version. True if attestation is mandatory, false otherwise.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,change_summary,change_summary,Policy Version Change Summary,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Narrative description of the changes introduced in this version compared to the prior version. Documents the rationale and scope of the revision for audit and training purposes.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,comment_log,comment_log,Policy Version Comment Log,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Aggregated comments and feedback collected during the review and approval process. Provides context for decisions made during policy development.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,distribution_list,distribution_list,Policy Version Distribution List,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Comma-separated list of departments, roles, or distribution groups to which this policy version was communicated. Documents policy dissemination for compliance purposes.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,document_checksum,document_checksum,Policy Version Document Checksum,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Cryptographic hash of the policy document file to ensure integrity and detect unauthorized modifications. Supports tamper-evidence requirements for regulatory compliance.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,document_url,document_url,Policy Version Document Uniform Resource Locator (URL),STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Link to the full policy document stored in the document management system or content repository. Enables direct access to the authoritative policy text.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,effective_date,effective_date,Policy Version Effective Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which this policy version becomes binding and enforceable. Critical for compliance audit trails and regulatory reporting.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,expiration_date,expiration_date,Policy Version Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which this policy version is superseded or retired. Null for currently active versions. Required for demonstrating continuous policy coverage during audits.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,language_code,language_code,Policy Version Language Code,STRING,,,,^[a-z]{2}$,transactional_data,Two-letter ISO 639-1 language code indicating the language of this policy version. Supports multilingual policy management for diverse workforce populations.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,next_review_due_date,next_review_due_date,Next Policy Review Due Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Calculated date by which the next policy review must be completed. Drives proactive policy maintenance and compliance with periodic review requirements.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,policy_type,policy_type,Policy Type Classification,STRING,,,,organizational|departmental|clinical_protocol|standard_operating_procedure|guideline|procedure,transactional_data,"Granular classification of the policy document type. Distinguishes between enterprise-wide policies, department-specific procedures, and clinical protocols.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,publication_date,publication_date,Policy Version Publication Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which this policy version was published to the organization. May differ from approval date to allow for communication planning and training preparation.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,regulatory_citation,regulatory_citation,Regulatory Citation Reference,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Formal citation or reference number for the regulatory requirement driving this policy version (e.g., 42 CFR 482.13, TJC LD.04.03.07). Enables traceability to source regulation.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,regulatory_driver,regulatory_driver,Regulatory Driver for Policy Revision,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Specific regulatory requirement, standard update, or compliance mandate that triggered this policy revision. Examples include new CMS Conditions of Participation, updated Joint Commission standards, or state health department rule changes.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,retirement_date,retirement_date,Policy Version Retirement Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which this policy version was formally retired or archived. Null for active or approved versions. Part of the complete lifecycle audit trail.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,retirement_reason,retirement_reason,Policy Version Retirement Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Explanation for why this policy version was retired or superseded. Documents the business or regulatory rationale for discontinuing the version.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,review_cycle_months,review_cycle_months,Policy Review Cycle Months,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"Number of months between required policy reviews. Defines the periodic review schedule to ensure policies remain current and compliant. Typically 12, 24, or 36 months per organizational standards.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,review_date,review_date,Policy Version Review Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which the policy version review was completed. Required to demonstrate timely review cycles per regulatory standards.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,scope_description,scope_description,Policy Version Scope Description,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Detailed description of the organizational units, roles, or processes to which this policy version applies. Clarifies applicability boundaries for compliance and training.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,training_due_days,training_due_days,Training Due Days,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of days from policy effective date by which staff must complete required training. Null if training is not required. Used to calculate training compliance deadlines.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,training_required_flag,training_required_flag,Training Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether staff training or attestation is required for this policy version. True if training is mandatory, false otherwise. Drives compliance training workflows.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,version_created_timestamp,version_created_timestamp,Policy Version Record Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Timestamp when this policy version record was first created in the system. Part of the audit trail for policy lifecycle management.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,version_modified_timestamp,version_modified_timestamp,Policy Version Record Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,Timestamp when this policy version record was last modified. Tracks updates to version metadata throughout the approval workflow.,
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,version_number,version_number,Policy Version Number,STRING,,,,^[0-9]+.[0-9]+(.[0-9]+)?$,transactional_data,"Semantic version identifier for this policy revision (e.g., 1.0, 2.1, 3.0.1). Follows organizational versioning convention to track major and minor revisions.",
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,version_status,version_status,Policy Version Status,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Current lifecycle state of this policy version. Tracks progression from draft through approval to retirement. Required for Joint Commission audit trail compliance. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: draft|under_review|approved|active|superseded|retired|archived — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
compliance,policy_management,policy_version,version_title,version_title,Policy Version Title,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Full descriptive title of the policy as it appears in this version. May change across versions to reflect scope or regulatory alignment updates.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,program_policy_assignment_id,program_policy_assignment_id,Program Policy Assignment Identifier,BIGINT,Y,,,,association_data,Unique identifier for this program-policy assignment record. Primary key.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,compliance_policy_id,compliance_policy_id,Program Policy Assignment - Policy Id,BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_policy.compliance_policy_id,,,association_data,Foreign key linking to the organizational policy assigned to this compliance program,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,primary_compliance_program_id,primary_compliance_program_id,Compliance Program Identifier,BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_program.compliance_program_id,,,association_data,Foreign key to compliance_program. Identifies which compliance program this policy is assigned to.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,assigned_by,assigned_by,Assignment Authority,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Name or role of the individual or committee that assigned this policy to this compliance program (e.g., Chief Compliance Officer, Compliance Committee).",
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,audit_frequency,audit_frequency,Program-Specific Audit Frequency,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Frequency at which compliance with this policy must be audited specifically under this compliance program. May differ from the programs general audit_frequency or the policys review cycle, as different programs may impose different audit requirements on the same policy.",
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,effective_date,effective_date,Assignment Effective Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when this policy became governed under this specific compliance program. May differ from the policys own effective_date if the policy was added to an existing program later.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,expiration_date,expiration_date,Assignment Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when this program-policy assignment expires or requires renewal. Nullable for permanent assignments.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,last_audit_date,last_audit_date,Last Program-Specific Audit Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,"Date when compliance with this policy was last audited specifically in the context of this compliance program. Tracks program-specific audit history, as the same policy may be audited at different times under different programs.",
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,last_review_date,last_review_date,Assignment Last Review Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when this program-policy assignment was last reviewed for continued relevance and accuracy.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,mandatory_flag,mandatory_flag,Program-Specific Mandatory Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,Indicates whether this policy is mandatory (true) or optional (false) specifically within the context of this compliance program. A policy may be mandatory under one program but optional under another.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,next_audit_date,next_audit_date,Next Program-Specific Audit Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Scheduled date for the next audit of this policy under this specific compliance program. Calculated based on the program-specific audit_frequency.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,next_review_date,next_review_date,Assignment Next Review Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Scheduled date for the next review of this program-policy assignment.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,program_scope_applicability,program_scope_applicability,Program Scope Applicability,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Description of how this policy applies within the scope of this specific compliance program. Captures program-specific applicability rules, exceptions, or scope limitations that may not apply when the same policy is governed under a different program.",
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,provider_assignment_date,provider_assignment_date,Assignment Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date when this policy was formally assigned to this compliance program. Tracks the governance decision date.,
compliance,policy_management,program_policy_assignment,provider_assignment_status,provider_assignment_status,Assignment Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current status of this program-policy assignment. Active assignments are in effect; suspended assignments are temporarily inactive; retired assignments are no longer in effect; under_review assignments are being evaluated for continued relevance.,
compliance,policy_management,regulatory_change,regulatory_change_id,regulatory_change_id,Regulatory Change ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the regulatory change record. Primary key.,
compliance,policy_management,regulatory_change,compliance_program_id,compliance_program_id,Compliance Program ID,BIGINT,,compliance.compliance_program.compliance_program_id,,,master_data,Reference to the primary compliance program affected by this regulatory change.,
