compliance,policy_management,regulatory_change,superseded_regulatory_change_id,superseded_regulatory_change_id,Superseded Regulatory Change Id,BIGINT,,compliance.regulatory_change.regulatory_change_id,dbx_self_ref_fk,,master_data,Self-referencing FK on regulatory_change (superseded_regulatory_change_id),
