compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,phi_access_log_id,phi_access_log_id,Phi Access Log Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,compliance.phi_access_log.phi_access_log_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to compliance.phi_access_log. Business justification: Investigations into unauthorized PHI access require direct linkage to the access log entries being investigated for evidence chain, timeline reconstruction, and disciplinary action documentation.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,breach_notification_required_flag,breach_notification_required_flag,Breach Notification Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether the investigation findings triggered mandatory breach notification to patients, HHS OCR, or media under HIPAA Breach Notification Rule. True indicates notification obligation exists.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,close_date,close_date,Investigation Close Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which the investigation was formally concluded and final determination documented. Null for open investigations.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,conclusion,conclusion,Investigation Conclusion,STRING,,,,violation_confirmed|no_violation|inconclusive|pending_review,transactional_data,Final determination of the investigation outcome. Violation confirmed indicates substantiated compliance breach. No violation indicates allegation not supported by evidence. Inconclusive indicates insufficient evidence to make determination. Pending review indicates investigation complete but awaiting final approval or legal review.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,confidentiality_level,confidentiality_level,Confidentiality Level,STRING,,,,public|internal|confidential|restricted,transactional_data,Data classification level governing access to and disclosure of investigation records. Restricted indicates highest sensitivity requiring need-to-know access. Confidential indicates limited distribution. Internal indicates organization-wide access. Public indicates no restriction.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,corrective_action_required_flag,corrective_action_required_flag,Corrective Action Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether the investigation findings require formal corrective action plan. True indicates CAP must be developed, approved, and tracked to completion.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,System timestamp recording when this investigation record was first created in the compliance management system. Used for audit trail and data lineage.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,department_involved,department_involved,Department Involved,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,Primary department or business unit where the alleged violation occurred or that is the subject of the investigation.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,disciplinary_action_taken_flag,disciplinary_action_taken_flag,Disciplinary Action Taken Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether employee disciplinary action was taken as a result of investigation findings, including counseling, suspension, termination, or other personnel action.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,external_referral_agency,external_referral_agency,External Referral Agency,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name of external regulatory, law enforcement, or oversight agency to which the investigation was referred, such as HHS OIG, DOJ, FBI, OCR, state attorney general, or state health department.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,external_referral_date,external_referral_date,External Referral Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which the investigation was formally referred to external authority. Null if no external referral made.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,financial_impact_amount,financial_impact_amount,Financial Impact Amount,"DECIMAL(15,2)",,,dbx_confidential,,transactional_data,"Estimated or calculated financial impact of the violation in US dollars, including overpayments, penalties, refunds, or potential liability exposure. Used for self-disclosure calculations and reserve estimation.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,findings_summary,findings_summary,Findings Summary,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Comprehensive narrative summary of the investigation findings, including evidence reviewed, interviews conducted, timeline of events, root cause analysis, and factual determinations. This field supports legal privilege and compliance program documentation.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,investigation_number,investigation_number,Investigation Number,STRING,,,,^INV-[0-9]{8}$,transactional_data,"Business-facing unique investigation case number assigned at initiation, formatted as INV-YYYYNNNN for tracking and reference in compliance documentation and legal proceedings.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,investigation_status,investigation_status,Investigation Status,STRING,,,,initiated|active|suspended|closed|escalated|referred_external,transactional_data,"Current lifecycle status of the investigation. Initiated indicates case opened but not yet assigned. Active indicates investigation in progress. Suspended indicates temporarily paused pending additional information. Closed indicates investigation concluded. Escalated indicates elevated to senior leadership or legal counsel. Referred external indicates case transferred to external authority such as OIG, OCR, or law enforcement.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,investigation_type,investigation_type,Investigation Type,STRING,,,,privacy_breach|billing_fraud|workplace_safety|abuse_neglect|anti_kickback|stark_violation,transactional_data,"Classification of the investigation based on the nature of the alleged compliance violation. Privacy breach covers HIPAA violations and unauthorized PHI disclosure. Billing fraud includes upcoding, unbundling, and false claims. Workplace safety covers OSHA violations. Abuse/neglect includes patient harm and mistreatment. Anti-kickback covers illegal remuneration. Stark violation covers physician self-referral violations.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,investigator_name,investigator_name,Investigator Name,STRING,,,"pii_phi,pii_pii,pii_sensitive",,transactional_data,Full name of the primary investigator assigned to this case for business reporting and audit trail purposes.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,legal_privilege_asserted_flag,legal_privilege_asserted_flag,Legal Privilege Asserted Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicator of whether attorney-client privilege or attorney work product privilege has been asserted over investigation materials. True indicates privileged status requiring special handling and access controls.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,System timestamp recording the most recent update to this investigation record. Used for audit trail and change tracking.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,notes,notes,Investigation Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-form text field for investigator notes, observations, and supplementary information not captured in structured fields. May include interview summaries, document references, and investigative leads.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,patient_count,patient_count,Patient Count,INT,,,,,transactional_data,Number of distinct patients affected by or involved in the alleged violation. Used to assess breach notification requirements under HIPAA and scope of potential harm.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,patient_involved_flag,patient_involved_flag,Patient Involved Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Indicator of whether the investigation involves a specific patient or patient PHI. True indicates patient-specific investigation requiring additional privacy protections and breach notification assessment.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,priority_level,priority_level,Priority Level,STRING,,,,critical|high|medium|low,transactional_data,"Urgency classification of the investigation based on severity of alleged violation, potential financial impact, patient safety risk, and regulatory exposure. Critical indicates immediate patient safety or significant regulatory risk. High indicates substantial compliance risk. Medium indicates moderate risk. Low indicates minor or technical violation.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,recommended_actions,recommended_actions,Recommended Actions,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Detailed recommendations for corrective and preventive actions resulting from investigation findings, including policy revisions, training requirements, system controls, disciplinary actions, and process improvements.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,regulatory_citation,regulatory_citation,Regulatory Citation,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Specific regulatory statute, rule, or standard that was violated, including citation reference such as HIPAA 45 CFR 164.502, False Claims Act 31 USC 3729, Stark Law 42 USC 1395nn, Anti-Kickback Statute 42 USC 1320a-7b, or OSHA standard number.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,risk_rating,risk_rating,Risk Rating,STRING,,,,extreme|high|moderate|low|minimal,transactional_data,"Assessment of the potential organizational risk exposure associated with the alleged violation, considering financial, reputational, regulatory, and patient safety dimensions.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,scope_description,scope_description,Investigation Scope Description,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Detailed narrative describing the boundaries and focus of the investigation, including specific allegations, time period under review, departments or individuals involved, and types of evidence to be examined.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,self_disclosure_date,self_disclosure_date,Self-Disclosure Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which voluntary self-disclosure was submitted to the applicable regulatory authority. Null if no disclosure required or not yet submitted.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,self_disclosure_required_flag,self_disclosure_required_flag,Self-Disclosure Required Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicator of whether the investigation findings require voluntary self-disclosure to regulatory authority such as OIG, CMS, or OCR under self-disclosure protocols. True indicates disclosure obligation exists.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,start_date,start_date,Investigation Start Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,Date on which the formal investigation was officially opened and investigative activities commenced. Used to track timeliness of investigation response and compliance with regulatory reporting deadlines.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,target_due_date,target_due_date,Target Due Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,"Target completion date for the investigation based on regulatory timelines, internal SLA, or urgency classification. Used to monitor investigation timeliness and escalate overdue cases.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,trigger_source,trigger_source,Trigger Source,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Origin or channel through which the investigation was initiated. Hotline report indicates anonymous or named report through compliance hotline. Audit finding indicates discovery during internal or external audit. Self-disclosure indicates proactive identification by organization. External referral indicates notification from regulatory body, payer, or law enforcement. Patient complaint indicates grievance filed by patient or family. Employee report indicates direct report from staff member. Regulatory inquiry indicates investigation prompted by CMS, OCR, or state agency request. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: hotline_report|audit_finding|self_disclosure|external_referral|patient_complaint|employee_report|regulatory_inquiry — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
compliance,workforce_integrity,investigation,violation_confirmed_flag,violation_confirmed_flag,Violation Confirmed Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,Boolean indicator of whether the investigation substantiated a compliance violation. True indicates confirmed violation requiring corrective action and potential self-disclosure.,
