compliance,workforce_integrity,training,prerequisite_training_id,prerequisite_training_id,Prerequisite Training Id,BIGINT,,compliance.training.training_id,dbx_self_ref_fk,,master_data,Self-referencing FK on training (prerequisite_training_id),
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,accreditation_body,accreditation_body,Accreditation Body,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Organization that has accredited or certified this training program. Examples: ANCC, AMA, AAFP. Null if not accredited.",
