compliance,workforce_integrity,training,duration_minutes,duration_minutes,Training Duration in Minutes,INT,,,,,master_data,Expected time in minutes required to complete the training program. Used for workforce planning and scheduling.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,effective_date,effective_date,Training Effective Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when this training program version became active and available for assignment. Used to track training content versioning.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,escalation_threshold_days,escalation_threshold_days,Escalation Threshold in Days,INT,,,,,master_data,Number of days past the due date after which non-completion triggers an escalation to management. Used for compliance enforcement.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,expiration_date,expiration_date,Training Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date when this training program version is no longer valid or available for new assignments. Null if the training has no planned end date.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,format,format,Training Format,STRING,,,,,master_data,Delivery method for the training program. Determines how learners access and complete the training. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: Online|In-Person|Blended|Simulation|On-the-Job|Self-Study|Webinar|Video — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,frequency,frequency,Training Frequency,STRING,,,,,master_data,How often the training must be completed to maintain compliance. Drives recurrence scheduling and assignment logic. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: Annual|Biennial|One-Time|Upon Hire|Upon Role Change|Quarterly|As Needed — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,frequency_months,frequency_months,Frequency in Months,INT,,,,,master_data,"Numeric representation of training recurrence interval in months. Used for automated scheduling. Examples: 12 for annual, 24 for biennial, null for one-time.",
