compliance,workforce_integrity,training,non_compliance_consequence,non_compliance_consequence,Non-Compliance Consequence,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of the organizational consequence for failing to complete required training. Examples: Loss of system access, disciplinary action, termination.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,passing_score_threshold,passing_score_threshold,Passing Score Threshold,"DECIMAL(5,2)",,,,,master_data,"Minimum score required to successfully complete the training, expressed as a percentage (0.00 to 100.00). Null if no assessment is required.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,policy_reference,policy_reference,Policy Reference,STRING,,,,,master_data,Reference to the organizational policy or policies that this training supports. Links training to the governance framework.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,priority_level,priority_level,Training Priority Level,STRING,,,,Critical|High|Medium|Low,master_data,Business priority assigned to this training program. Critical and High priority training may trigger escalation workflows for non-completion.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,regulatory_authority,regulatory_authority,Regulatory Authority,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The governing body or agency that mandates this training requirement. Examples: HHS Office for Civil Rights, OSHA, CMS, The Joint Commission, State Department of Health.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,regulatory_mandate,regulatory_mandate,Regulatory Mandate,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The specific regulation, statute, or accreditation standard that requires this training. Examples: HIPAA Privacy Rule 45 CFR 164.530(b), OSHA 29 CFR 1910.1030, Joint Commission HR.01.06.01.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,retired_reason,retired_reason,Training Retired Reason,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Explanation for why the training program was retired. Examples: Superseded by new version, Regulatory requirement removed, Content no longer relevant.",
