compliance,workforce_integrity,training,training_description,training_description,Training Description,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Detailed description of the training program content, scope, and purpose. Displayed to learners and used for catalog search.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,training_name,training_name,Training Program Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,Full name of the compliance training program as displayed to learners and in catalogs.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,training_number,training_number,Training Program Number,STRING,,,,"^TRN-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}$",master_data,"Business identifier for the training program, used for external reference and reporting. Typically follows format TRN-XXXXXX.",
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,training_status,training_status,Training Program Status,STRING,,,,Active|Inactive|Under Development|Under Review|Retired|Suspended,master_data,Current lifecycle status of the training program. Active programs are available for assignment and completion.,
compliance,workforce_integrity,training,training_type,training_type,Training Type,STRING,,,,,master_data,Category of compliance training program. Defines the subject matter and regulatory domain covered by the training. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: HIPAA Privacy|HIPAA Security|Corporate Compliance|OSHA Bloodborne Pathogens|Fire Safety|Abuse and Neglect|Cultural Competency|Code of Conduct|Emergency Preparedness|Infection Control|Patient Rights|Workplace Violence Prevention|Hazardous Materials|Radiation Safety|Respiratory Protection|Other — 16 candidates stripped; promote to reference product],
