compliance,workforce_integrity,training_completion,accreditation_body,accreditation_body,Training Accreditation Body,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name of the organization that accredited or approved this training program. Examples include ACCME, ANCC, state boards, or internal compliance committees.",
