finance,ledger_accounting,finance_journal_entry_line,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,transactional_data,Foreign key linking to finance.cost_center. Business justification: journal_entry_line has cost_center_code (STRING) which should be normalized to FK to cost_center master. Enables joining to get cost center details for journal entry line allocation.,
finance,ledger_accounting,finance_journal_entry_line,drg_id,drg_id,Drg Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,reference.drg.drg_id,,,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to reference.drg. Business justification: Healthcare finance requires linking journal entries to DRGs for Medicare cost reporting, case-mix analysis, and reimbursement reconciliation. The existing drg_code string should be replaced with a pro",
finance,ledger_accounting,finance_journal_entry_line,finance_employee_id,finance_employee_id,Created By User Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,FK to workforce.employee identifying the employee who posted this journal entry line to the general ledger,
