finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,finance_employee_id,finance_employee_id,Approver Employee ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,Identifier of the employee who approved the budget transfer. Links to the employee master data for authorization tracking and compliance.,
