finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,primary_employee_id,primary_employee_id,Budget Transfer Modified By User ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,FK to workforce.employee identifying the employee who last modified this budget transfer record,
