finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,source_chart_of_accounts_id,source_chart_of_accounts_id,Source General Ledger (GL) Account ID,BIGINT,,finance.chart_of_accounts.chart_of_accounts_id,,,transactional_data,Identifier of the general ledger account from which budget funds are being transferred. Links to the chart of accounts.,
