finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,tertiary_employee_id,tertiary_employee_id,Requestor Employee ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,transactional_data,Identifier of the employee who initiated or requested the budget transfer. Links to the employee master data for accountability tracking.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,approval_date,approval_date,Budget Transfer Approval Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date when the budget transfer was formally approved by the authorized approver. Null if transfer is not yet approved.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,approval_level,approval_level,Budget Transfer Approval Level,STRING,,,,department_manager|director|vice_president|chief_financial_officer|board_of_directors,transactional_data,"The organizational level at which the budget transfer was approved, indicating the authority level required based on transfer amount and type: department_manager, director, vice_president, chief_financial_officer (CFO), or board_of_directors.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,approver_name,approver_name,Approver Name,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Full name of the employee who approved the budget transfer, captured for audit trail and accountability.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,audit_trail_reference,audit_trail_reference,Budget Transfer Audit Trail Reference,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Reference identifier to the complete audit trail or change log for this budget transfer, linking to detailed history of all modifications and approvals.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,batch_code,batch_code,Budget Transfer Batch ID,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Identifier for a batch or group of related budget transfers processed together, typically used for mass budget adjustments or year-end reallocations.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,comments,comments,Budget Transfer Comments,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Additional free-text comments, notes, or context about the budget transfer that do not fit in other structured fields. Used for collaboration and documentation.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,compliance_flag,compliance_flag,Budget Transfer Compliance Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Boolean indicator of whether this budget transfer complies with all applicable financial policies, regulatory requirements, and budget constraints. True if compliant, False if exceptions exist.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,compliance_notes,compliance_notes,Budget Transfer Compliance Notes,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Free-text notes documenting compliance review findings, exceptions, or special considerations related to regulatory or policy requirements.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Budget Transfer Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,System timestamp when this budget transfer record was first created in the database. Part of standard audit trail for data lineage.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,currency_code,currency_code,Currency Code,STRING,,,,^[A-Z]{3}$,transactional_data,"Three-letter ISO 4217 currency code for the transfer amount (e.g., USD, EUR, GBP). Required for multi-currency healthcare systems.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,effective_date,effective_date,Budget Transfer Effective Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date when the budget transfer becomes binding and the budget changes take effect in the financial system. May differ from transfer_date for future-dated transfers.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,fiscal_period,fiscal_period,Fiscal Period,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"The fiscal period (month or quarter) within the fiscal year to which this transfer applies, typically 1-12 for monthly periods or 1-4 for quarterly periods.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,fiscal_year,fiscal_year,Fiscal Year,INT,,,,,transactional_data,"The fiscal year to which this budget transfer applies, typically a four-digit year (e.g., 2024). Critical for period-based budget management and year-end reconciliation.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Budget Transfer Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,transactional_data,System timestamp when this budget transfer record was last modified in the database. Part of standard audit trail for change tracking.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,requestor_department,requestor_department,Requestor Department,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Name of the department or organizational unit of the employee who requested the transfer, for organizational analysis and reporting.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,requestor_name,requestor_name,Requestor Name,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"pii_phi,pii_pii,pii_sensitive",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,reversal_date,reversal_date,Budget Transfer Reversal Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,The date when this budget transfer was reversed or undone. Null if the transfer has not been reversed.,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,reversal_flag,reversal_flag,Budget Transfer Reversal Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Boolean indicator of whether this budget transfer has been reversed or undone. True if reversed, False if still in effect.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,reversal_reason,reversal_reason,Budget Transfer Reversal Reason,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Narrative explanation of why the budget transfer was reversed, including business justification and corrective action taken.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,supporting_document_reference,supporting_document_reference,Supporting Document Reference,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Reference identifier or URI to supporting documentation for the budget transfer (e.g., memo, business case, board resolution, email approval). Critical for audit trail and compliance.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_amount,transfer_amount,Budget Transfer Amount,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,transactional_data,Cleaned boilerplate phrase from attribute description,
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_date,transfer_date,Budget Transfer Date,DATE,,,,,transactional_data,"The business date when the budget transfer was initiated or became effective. This is the principal business event timestamp for the transaction, distinct from audit timestamps.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_number,transfer_number,Budget Transfer Number,STRING,,,,^BT-[0-9]{8}$,transactional_data,"Externally-visible unique business identifier for the budget transfer, typically formatted as BT-YYYYNNNN for tracking and audit purposes.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_reason_code,transfer_reason_code,Budget Transfer Reason Code,STRING,,,,operational_need|cost_overrun|revenue_shortfall|strategic_priority|regulatory_requirement|emergency_response,transactional_data,"Standardized code indicating the primary business reason for the budget transfer: operational_need (operational requirements changed), cost_overrun (original budget insufficient), revenue_shortfall (revenue below projections), strategic_priority (strategic initiative funding), regulatory_requirement (compliance mandate), or emergency_response (urgent unplanned need).",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_reason_description,transfer_reason_description,Budget Transfer Reason Description,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Detailed narrative explanation of the business justification for the budget transfer, including context, impact, and supporting rationale. Critical for audit trail and management review.",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_status,transfer_status,Budget Transfer Status,STRING,,,,,transactional_data,"Current lifecycle state of the budget transfer: draft (being prepared), pending_approval (submitted for review), approved (authorized to proceed), rejected (denied), in_progress (being executed), completed (fully processed), cancelled (withdrawn before completion), or reversed (undone after completion). [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: draft|pending_approval|approved|rejected|in_progress|completed|cancelled|reversed — 8 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
finance,planning_budgets,finance_budget_transfer,transfer_type,transfer_type,Budget Transfer Type,STRING,,,,budget_amendment|budget_transfer|budget_revision|budget_reallocation|supplemental_appropriation|technical_adjustment,transactional_data,"Classification of the budget modification: budget amendment (formal change to approved budget), budget transfer (movement between cost centers), budget revision (adjustment to budget assumptions), budget reallocation (redistribution within same department), supplemental appropriation (additional funding), or technical adjustment (correction without policy change).",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,financial_forecast_id,financial_forecast_id,Financial Forecast ID,BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the financial forecast record. Primary key.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,care_site_id,care_site_id,Facility ID,BIGINT,,facility.care_site.care_site_id,,,master_data,Identifier of the healthcare facility or entity to which this forecast applies. Supports facility-level and consolidated financial planning.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center ID,BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,master_data,"Identifier of the cost center to which this forecast applies, if the forecast is prepared at the cost center level rather than enterprise-wide.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,financial_employee_id,financial_employee_id,Approver Employee ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,master_data,Identifier of the executive or manager who approved this forecast. Links to the employee or workforce management system.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,financial_entity_id,financial_entity_id,Financial Entity Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.financial_entity.financial_entity_id,,,master_data,Foreign key linking to finance.financial_entity. Business justification: financial_forecast should link to financial_entity to identify which legal entity the forecast belongs to. This is essential for multi-entity healthcare organizations to track forecasts by subsidiary.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,org_unit_id,org_unit_id,Department ID,BIGINT,,workforce.org_unit.org_unit_id,,,master_data,"Identifier of the department to which this forecast applies, if the forecast is prepared at the department level.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,parent_financial_forecast_id,parent_financial_forecast_id,Parent Forecast ID,BIGINT,,finance.financial_forecast.financial_forecast_id,,,master_data,Identifier of the parent forecast if this forecast is a component of a larger consolidated forecast. Supports hierarchical financial planning structures.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,primary_employee_id,primary_employee_id,Preparer Employee ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,master_data,Identifier of the finance team member who prepared this forecast. Links to the employee or workforce management system.,
