finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,tertiary_employee_id,tertiary_employee_id,Modified By User ID,BIGINT,,workforce.employee.employee_id,"dbx_confidential, dbx_pii",,master_data,System user identifier of the person who last modified this forecast record. Supports audit trail and accountability.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,approval_date,approval_date,Approval Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the forecast was formally approved by the designated authority. Marks the transition to official plan of record.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,assumptions_narrative,assumptions_narrative,Assumptions Narrative,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Detailed narrative documenting the key assumptions, drivers, and rationale underlying the forecast. Includes market conditions, volume assumptions, rate assumptions, cost inflation factors, strategic initiatives, and risk factors.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,baseline_flag,baseline_flag,Baseline Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether this forecast version is the official baseline plan of record against which actual performance will be measured. True if baseline, False otherwise.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,board_presentation_date,board_presentation_date,Board Presentation Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which this forecast was presented to the board of directors or trustees. Null if not presented.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,board_presentation_flag,board_presentation_flag,Board Presentation Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,master_data,"Indicates whether this forecast was presented to the board of directors or trustees. True if presented, False otherwise. Used for governance and reporting tracking.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Date and time when this forecast record was first created in the system. Supports audit trail and data lineage.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,currency_code,currency_code,Currency Code,STRING,,,,^[A-Z]{3}$,master_data,"Three-letter ISO 4217 currency code for all monetary amounts in this forecast (e.g., USD for US Dollar). Ensures consistent financial reporting across multi-currency environments.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,facility_service_line_code,facility_service_line_code,Service Line Code,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Code identifying the clinical service line to which this forecast applies (e.g., cardiology, orthopedics, oncology). Supports service line financial planning and performance management.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,fiscal_year,fiscal_year,Fiscal Year,INT,,,,,master_data,"The fiscal year to which this forecast applies, represented as a four-digit year (e.g., 2024). Aligns with the organizations fiscal calendar.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_methodology,forecast_methodology,Forecast Methodology,STRING,,,,,master_data,"The forecasting technique or approach used to develop the projections. Trend analysis extrapolates historical patterns, driver-based links to operational metrics, zero-based builds from scratch, activity-based costs by activity, regression uses statistical models. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: trend_analysis|driver_based|zero_based|activity_based|regression_model|scenario_planning|hybrid — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_name,forecast_name,Forecast Name,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Descriptive name of the financial forecast, typically indicating the planning cycle or scenario (e.g., FY2024 Q2 Rolling Forecast, Long-Range Strategic Plan 2024-2028).",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_number,forecast_number,Forecast Number,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Business-assigned unique identifier for the forecast, used for external reference and tracking across financial planning cycles.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_period_end_date,forecast_period_end_date,Forecast Period End Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,The last date of the period covered by this forecast. Defines the end of the planning horizon.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_period_months,forecast_period_months,Forecast Period Months,INT,,,,,master_data,"Number of months covered by the forecast period. Typical values include 12 for annual plans, 18-24 for rolling forecasts, and 36-60 for long-range plans.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_period_start_date,forecast_period_start_date,Forecast Period Start Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,The first date of the period covered by this forecast. Defines the beginning of the planning horizon.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_status,forecast_status,Forecast Status,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Current lifecycle state of the forecast. Draft indicates work in progress, submitted awaits review, approved is finalized, baseline is the official plan of record, superseded has been replaced by a newer version. [ENUM-REF-CANDIDATE: draft|submitted|under_review|approved|baseline|superseded|archived — 7 candidates stripped; promote to reference product]",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_type,forecast_type,Forecast Type,STRING,,,,rolling_forecast|annual_operating_plan|long_range_plan|scenario_analysis|budget_reforecast|strategic_plan,master_data,"Classification of the forecast methodology and planning horizon. Rolling forecasts update continuously, annual operating plans cover a single fiscal year, long-range plans span multiple years, and scenario analyses model alternative futures.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecast_version,forecast_version,Forecast Version,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Version identifier for the forecast, enabling tracking of iterations and revisions (e.g., V1.0, V2.1, Q2 Update). Supports audit trail and version control.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecasted_cmi,forecasted_cmi,Forecasted Case Mix Index (CMI),"DECIMAL(5,4)",,,,,master_data,"Projected average case mix index for the forecast period, reflecting the expected complexity and resource intensity of patient cases. Used for revenue and cost modeling under DRG-based payment systems.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecasted_fte_count,forecasted_fte_count,Forecasted Full-Time Equivalent (FTE) Count,"DECIMAL(10,2)",,,,,master_data,Projected total full-time equivalent staffing levels for the forecast period. Critical for labor cost planning and productivity analysis.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,forecasted_patient_volume,forecasted_patient_volume,Forecasted Patient Volume,INT,,,,,master_data,Projected total patient encounters or admissions for the forecast period. Key volume driver for revenue and resource planning.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,modified_timestamp,modified_timestamp,Modified Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,master_data,Date and time when this forecast record was last modified. Supports audit trail and change tracking.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,notes,notes,Notes,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Free-text field for additional comments, context, or special instructions related to this forecast. Used for collaboration and documentation.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,scenario_description,scenario_description,Scenario Description,STRING,,,,,master_data,"Description of the scenario being modeled (e.g., base case, best case, worst case, strategic initiative impact). Used for scenario analysis and sensitivity testing.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,submission_date,submission_date,Submission Date,DATE,,,,,master_data,Date on which the forecast was submitted for review and approval. Tracks the workflow progression.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,total_forecasted_capital_expenditure,total_forecasted_capital_expenditure,Total Forecasted Capital Expenditure,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,master_data,"Total projected capital spending for the forecast period, including facility construction, equipment purchases, technology investments, and major renovations.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,total_forecasted_expense,total_forecasted_expense,Total Forecasted Expense,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,master_data,"Total projected operating expenses for the forecast period, including salaries and benefits, supplies, purchased services, depreciation, and other operating costs.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,total_forecasted_net_income,total_forecasted_net_income,Total Forecasted Net Income,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,master_data,"Projected net income after all revenues, expenses, non-operating items, and taxes. Bottom line of the forecasted income statement.",
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,total_forecasted_operating_income,total_forecasted_operating_income,Total Forecasted Operating Income,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,master_data,Projected operating income (revenue minus expenses) for the forecast period. Key performance metric for financial sustainability and operational efficiency.,
finance,planning_budgets,financial_forecast,total_forecasted_revenue,total_forecasted_revenue,Total Forecasted Revenue,"DECIMAL(18,2)",,,,,master_data,"Total projected operating revenue for the forecast period, including patient service revenue, capitation revenue, and other operating income. Represents the top line of the forecasted income statement.",
finance,planning_budgets,forecast_line,forecast_line_id,forecast_line_id,Forecast Line Identifier (ID),BIGINT,Y,,,,master_data,Unique identifier for the forecast line item. Primary key for the forecast line entity.,
