finance,planning_budgets,forecast_line,cost_center_id,cost_center_id,Cost Center Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.cost_center.cost_center_id,,,master_data,Foreign key linking to finance.cost_center. Business justification: forecast_line has cost_center_code (STRING) which should be normalized to FK to cost_center master. Enables joining to get cost center details and ensures referential integrity.,
finance,planning_budgets,forecast_line,financial_forecast_id,financial_forecast_id,Forecast Identifier (ID),BIGINT,,finance.financial_forecast.financial_forecast_id,,,master_data,Reference to the parent financial forecast header that this line belongs to. Links to the forecast master record.,
finance,planning_budgets,forecast_line,fund_id,fund_id,Fund Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,finance.fund.fund_id,,,master_data,Foreign key linking to finance.fund. Business justification: forecast_line has fund_code (STRING) which should be normalized to FK to fund master. Enables joining to get fund details and ensures forecast lines reference valid funds.,
