finance,treasury_operations,finance_bank_reconciliation,consent_exception_flag,consent_exception_flag,Exception Flag,BOOLEAN,,,,,transactional_data,"Indicates whether this reconciliation contains exceptions or unusual items requiring management attention. True indicates exceptions exist, false indicates a clean reconciliation.",
