finance,treasury_operations,finance_bank_reconciliation,currency_code,currency_code,Currency Code,STRING,,,,^[A-Z]{3}$,transactional_data,Three-letter ISO 4217 currency code for the bank account being reconciled. Indicates the currency in which all monetary amounts are denominated.,
