workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,competency_level,competency_level,Competency Level,STRING,,,,,association_data,Level of clinical competency and autonomy granted for this specific procedure. Unrestricted = full independent practice. Supervised = requires attending physician oversight. Proctored = requires observation by peer for quality assurance. Provisional = temporary privilege pending completion of competency assessment.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,created_timestamp,created_timestamp,Created Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Timestamp when this clinical privilege record was created in the medical staff services system.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,granting_committee,granting_committee,Granting Committee,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Name of the medical staff committee or delegated authority that granted this privilege (e.g., Credentials Committee, Surgery Department, Emergency Medicine Section). Used for governance tracking and appeals process.",
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,last_proctoring_date,last_proctoring_date,Last Proctoring Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date of the most recent proctored case for this privilege. Used for competency assessment and progression from proctored to unrestricted status. Null if no proctoring has occurred or is not required.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,privilege_expiration_date,privilege_expiration_date,Privilege Expiration Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which this clinical privilege expires and requires renewal through the reappointment process. Typically aligned with medical staff appointment cycle (1-2 years). Null for permanently revoked privileges.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,privilege_grant_date,privilege_grant_date,Privilege Grant Date,DATE,,,,,association_data,Date on which the medical staff credentialing committee or delegated authority granted this specific clinical privilege to the workforce member. Used for privilege history tracking and reappointment scheduling.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,privilege_status,privilege_status,Privilege Status,STRING,,,,,association_data,Current lifecycle status of the clinical privilege. Active privileges are valid for clinical operations. Suspended privileges are temporarily inactive pending review. Expired privileges require renewal. Revoked privileges have been permanently removed. Pending privileges are under credentialing committee review.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,proctoring_cases_completed,proctoring_cases_completed,Proctoring Cases Completed,INT,,,,,association_data,Number of proctored cases completed for this privilege. Used to track progress toward unrestricted privilege status. Null if proctoring is not required.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,proctoring_cases_required,proctoring_cases_required,Proctoring Cases Required,INT,,,,,association_data,Total number of proctored cases required before privilege can be upgraded to unrestricted status. Set by credentialing committee based on procedure complexity and clinician experience. Null if proctoring is not required.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,restriction_notes,restriction_notes,Restriction Notes,STRING,,,,,association_data,"Free-text description of any specific restrictions, conditions, or limitations placed on this privilege by the credentialing committee. Examples: age restrictions, anatomical site restrictions, technology restrictions. Null if no restrictions apply.",
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,supervision_required,supervision_required,Supervision Required,BOOLEAN,,,,,association_data,"Indicates whether this specific privilege requires direct supervision by an attending physician or senior clinician. True for residents, fellows, and clinicians with provisional or supervised competency levels. False for unrestricted privileges.",
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,updated_timestamp,updated_timestamp,Updated Timestamp,TIMESTAMP,,,,,association_data,Timestamp when this clinical privilege record was last modified. Used for audit trail and change tracking.,
workforce,credential_privileging,clinical_privilege,volume_requirement,volume_requirement,Volume Requirement,INT,,,,,association_data,Minimum number of procedures the clinician must perform annually to maintain competency and privilege renewal eligibility. Used by medical staff services for ongoing professional practice evaluation (OPPE). Null if no volume requirement applies.,
