workforce,credential_privileging,competency_assessment,diagnosis_icd_code_id,diagnosis_icd_code_id,Diagnosis Icd Code Id (Foreign Key),BIGINT,,reference.icd_code.icd_code_id,"dbx_pii_health,dbx_restricted,pii_phi",,transactional_data,"Foreign key linking to reference.icd_code. Business justification: Vaccine administration competencies linked to immunization encounter diagnosis codes (Z23). Real-world: vaccine administration training documentation, immunization competency tied to specific vaccines",
