workforce,staff_administration,job_profile,pay_range_midpoint,pay_range_midpoint,Pay Range Midpoint,"DECIMAL(12,2)",,,dbx_confidential,,reference_data,Midpoint of the base salary or hourly rate range for this job profile. Represents the market reference point used in compensation benchmarking and compa-ratio calculations.,
