workforce,staff_administration,job_profile,pay_rate_type,pay_rate_type,Pay Rate Type,STRING,,,,Salary|Hourly|Daily,reference_data,"Indicates whether compensation for this job profile is expressed as an annual salary, an hourly rate, or a daily rate. Drives payroll calculation logic and FLSA overtime applicability.",
workforce,staff_administration,job_profile,privileging_required,privileging_required,Privileging Required Indicator,BOOLEAN,,,,,reference_data,"Indicates whether clinical privileging through the medical staff office is required for this job profile. Applicable to physicians, advanced practice providers, and other credentialed clinical staff. Integrates with Symplr privileging workflows.",
