workforce,staff_administration,job_profile,union_code,union_code,Union Code,STRING,,,,,reference_data,"Code identifying the specific union or collective bargaining unit associated with this job profile, if applicable (e.g., SEIU, AFSCME, CNA). Used to apply CBA-specific compensation, scheduling, and benefit rules.",
